1
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:20,800
<b><font color="#ff9d12">Jm Gacho Subs</font></b>

2
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Report
to your stations immediately.</i></b></font>

3
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,616
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>This is not a drill.</i></b></font>

4
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,776
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We are under attack!</i></b></font>

5
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,088
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We are under attack!</i></b></font>

6
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Shit!
- Language!</b></font>

7
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,204
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Jarvis, what's the view from upstairs?</b></font>

8
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:57,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The central building is</i></b></font>

9
00:01:57,760 --> 00:02:00,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>protected by some kind
of energy shield.</i></b></font>

10
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Strucker's technology is well beyond</i></b></font>

11
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:04,522
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>any other Hydra base we've taken.</i></b></font>

12
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Loki's sceptre must be here.</b></font>

13
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Strucker couldn't
mount this defence without it.</b></font>

14
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,730
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>At long last.</b></font>

15
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:27,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"At long last" is lasting
a little long, boys.</b></font>

16
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:34,846
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah. I think we lost
the element of surprise.</b></font>

17
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,607
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wait a second.
No one else is gonna deal with the fact</b></font>

18
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:40,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>that Cap just said "Language"?</b></font>

19
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,205
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know.</b></font>

20
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just slipped out.</b></font>

21
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,364
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Who gave the order to attack?</b></font>

22
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:59,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Herr Strucker, it's the Avengers.</b></font>

23
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:02,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They landed in the far woods.
The perimeter guard panicked.</b></font>

24
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:04,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They have to be after the sceptre.</b></font>

25
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Can we hold them?
- They're the Avengers.</b></font>

26
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,164
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Deploy the rest of the tanks.</b></font>

27
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:12,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Concentrate fire on the weak ones.</b></font>

28
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A hit may make them close ranks.</b></font>

29
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:18,123
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Everything we've accomplished...</b></font>

30
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But we're on the verge of
our greatest breakthrough.</b></font>

31
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,404
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Then let's show them
what we've accomplished.</b></font>

32
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,204
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Send out the twins.</b></font>

33
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:27,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's too soon.</b></font>

34
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's what they signed up for.</b></font>

35
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:32,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>My men can hold them.</b></font>

36
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:41,529
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Sir, the city is taking fire.</i></b></font>

37
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:47,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, we know Strucker's not gonna
worry about civilian casualties.</b></font>

38
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Send in the Iron Legion.</b></font>

39
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:57,491
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>This quadrant is unsafe.
Please back away.</i></b></font>

40
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We are here to help.</i></b></font>

41
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:03,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>This quadrant is unsafe.
Please back away.</i></b></font>

42
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Please back away.</i></b></font>

43
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,656
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- <i>We wish to avoid collateral damage.</i>
- Costel!</b></font>

44
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:11,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We will inform you
when this current conflict is resolved.</i></b></font>

45
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- <i>We are here to help.</i>
- Avengers, go home!</b></font>

46
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We are here to help.</i></b></font>

47
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We will not yield!</i></b></font>

48
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:23,768
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Americans sent
their circus freaks to test us.</b></font>

49
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:26,806
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We will send them back in bags.</b></font>

50
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:32,050
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- No surrender!
- No surrender!</b></font>

51
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:35,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am going to surrender.</b></font>

52
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You delete everything.</b></font>

53
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,084
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If we give the Avengers the weapons,</b></font>

54
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:40,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>they may not look
too far into what we've been...</b></font>

55
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- The twins.
- They are not ready to take on...</b></font>

56
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:45,247
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, no, I mean...</b></font>

57
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Twins.</b></font>

58
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:15,083
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You didn't see that coming?</b></font>

59
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Clint!</b></font>

60
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,136
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We have an Enhanced in the field.</b></font>

61
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Clint's hit!</b></font>

62
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:34,136
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Somebody want to
deal with that bunker?</b></font>

63
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

64
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:48,880
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark, we really need to get inside.</b></font>

65
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm closing in.</b></font>

66
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:55,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Jarvis, am I closing in?</b></font>

67
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do you see a power source
for that shield?</b></font>

68
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:01,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>There's a particle wave
below the north tower.</i></b></font>

69
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Great,
I want to poke it with something.</b></font>

70
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:13,123
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The drawbridge is down, people.</b></font>

71
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:19,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- The Enhanced?
- He's a blur.</b></font>

72
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:22,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All the new players we've faced,
I've never seen this.</b></font>

73
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>In fact, I still haven't.</b></font>

74
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:26,296
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Clint's hit pretty bad,
guys. We're gonna need evac.</i></b></font>

75
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:27,765
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can get Barton to the jet.</b></font>

76
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The sooner we're gone, the better.</b></font>

77
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:30,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You and Stark secure the sceptre.</b></font>

78
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Copy that.</b></font>

79
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,769
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Looks like they're lining up.</b></font>

80
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,570
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, they're excited.</b></font>

81
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,805
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Find the sceptre.</b></font>

82
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:45,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And for gosh sake, watch your language!</b></font>

83
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:48,403
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's not going away any time soon.</b></font>

84
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Guys, stop. We gotta talk this through.</b></font>

85
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It was a good talk.</i></b></font>

86
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, it wasn't.</b></font>

87
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,610
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh!</b></font>

88
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,283
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sentry mode.</b></font>

89
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,529
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay, Jarvis, you know. I want it all.</b></font>

90
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,603
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Make sure you copy Hill at HQ.</b></font>

91
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're locked down out here.</b></font>

92
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:24,968
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Then get to Banner. Time for a lullaby.</b></font>

93
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know you're hiding more than files.</b></font>

94
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:34,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, J, give me
an IR scan of the room, real quick.</b></font>

95
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The wall to your left.</i></b></font>

96
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:38,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I'm reading steel reinforcement.</i></b></font>

97
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,890
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And an air current.</i></b></font>

98
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Please be a secret door.</b></font>

99
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:44,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Please be a secret door.
Please be a secret door.</b></font>

100
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yay.</b></font>

101
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:04,123
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, big guy.</b></font>

102
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:08,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sun's getting real low.</b></font>

103
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Baron Strucker.</b></font>

104
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:16,243
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hydra's number one thug.</b></font>

105
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Technically, I'm a thug for S.H.I.E.L.D.</b></font>

106
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:21,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, then technically
you're unemployed.</b></font>

107
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Where's Loki's sceptre?</b></font>

108
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:25,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Don't worry,
I know when I'm beat.</b></font>

109
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:29,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You'll mention how I cooperated, I hope.</b></font>

110
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:31,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll put it right under
"illegal human experimentation."</b></font>

111
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How many are there?</b></font>

112
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:42,404
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We have a second Enhanced.
Female. Do not engage.</b></font>

113
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,330
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You'll have to be faster than...</b></font>

114
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:52,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Guys, I got Strucker.</i></b></font>

115
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:55,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, I got something bigger.</b></font>

116
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Thor,</i></b></font>

117
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:23,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I got eyes on the prize.</b></font>

118
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:16,248
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You could have saved us.</b></font>

119
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:26,248
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Why didn't you do more?</i></b></font>

120
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're just gonna let him take it?</b></font>

121
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:59,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, the lullaby worked better than ever.</b></font>

122
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:03,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just wasn't expecting a code green.</b></font>

123
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You hadn't been there,</b></font>

124
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:07,404
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>there would have been
double the casualties.</b></font>

125
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:10,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>My best friend
would've been a treasured memory.</b></font>

126
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:12,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know,
sometimes exactly what I want to hear</b></font>

127
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,649
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>isn't exactly what I want to hear.</b></font>

128
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How long before you trust me?</b></font>

129
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,449
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's not you I don't trust.</b></font>

130
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor, report on the Hulk.</b></font>

131
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:28,084
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The gates of Hel are filled with
the screams of his victims.</b></font>

132
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:33,124
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But not the screams of the dead, of course.
No, no, wounded screams.</b></font>

133
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:35,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mainly whimpering,
a great deal of complaining</b></font>

134
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:39,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and tales of sprained deltoids and gout.</b></font>

135
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:42,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, Banner
Dr. Cho is on her way in from Seoul.</b></font>

136
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,616
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is it okay if she sets up in your lab?</b></font>

137
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:46,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, yeah, she knows her way around.</b></font>

138
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:47,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thanks. Tell her to prep everything.</b></font>

139
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Barton's gonna need the full treatment.</b></font>

140
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:51,576
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- <i> Very good, sir.</i>
- Jarvis, take the wheel.</b></font>

141
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Yes, sir.</i></b></font>

142
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,889
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Approach vector is locked.</i></b></font>

143
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:57,441
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Feels good, yeah?</b></font>

144
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:59,642
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I mean, you've been after this thing
since S.H.I.E.L.D. collapsed.</b></font>

145
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not that I haven't enjoyed
our little raiding parties, but...</b></font>

146
00:14:01,920 --> 00:14:04,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, but this... This brings it to a close.</b></font>

147
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:06,923
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>As soon as we find out
what else this has been used for.</b></font>

148
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't just mean weapons.</b></font>

149
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:11,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Since when is Strucker capable
of human enhancement?</b></font>

150
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:13,521
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Banner and I will give it the once over
before it goes back to Asgard.</b></font>

151
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:14,736
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is that cool with you?</b></font>

152
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:16,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just a few days till the farewell party.</b></font>

153
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:19,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're staying, right?</b></font>

154
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:21,931
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, yes, of course. A victory
should be honoured with revels.</b></font>

155
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:24,805
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, who doesn't love revels? Captain?</b></font>

156
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:27,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hopefully this puts an end
to the Chitauri and Hydra.</b></font>

157
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:29,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, yes, revels.</b></font>

158
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:04,687
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Lab's all set up, boss.</b></font>

159
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, actually, he's the boss.</b></font>

160
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:08,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I just pay for everything
and design everything</b></font>

161
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:10,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and make everyone look cooler.</b></font>

162
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,685
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What's the word on Strucker?</b></font>

163
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:13,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- NATO's got him.
- The two Enhanced?</b></font>

164
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:16,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wanda and Pietro Maximoff. Twins.</b></font>

165
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:19,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Orphaned at 10 when a shell
collapsed their apartment building.</b></font>

166
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:22,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sokovia's had a rough history.</b></font>

167
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:25,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's nowhere special, but it's
on the way to everywhere special.</b></font>

168
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Their abilities?</b></font>

169
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,336
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's got increased metabolism</b></font>

170
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,964
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and improved thermal homeostasis.</b></font>

171
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:32,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Her thing is neuroelectric interfacing,</b></font>

172
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:34,402
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>telekinesis, mental manipulation.</b></font>

173
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:36,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's fast and she's weird.</b></font>

174
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:39,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, they're gonna show up again.</b></font>

175
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:41,603
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Agreed. File says they volunteered</b></font>

176
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:43,529
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>for Strucker's experiments.</b></font>

177
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:45,529
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- It's nuts.
- Right.</b></font>

178
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:48,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What kind of monster would let
a German scientist experiment on them</b></font>

179
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to protect their country?</b></font>

180
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:52,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're not at war, Captain.</b></font>

181
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:53,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They are.</b></font>

182
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,371
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How's he doing?</b></font>

183
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Unfortunately, he's still Barton.</b></font>

184
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's terrible.</b></font>

185
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's fine. He's thirsty.</b></font>

186
00:16:30,040 --> 00:16:32,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right. Look alive, Jarvis.
It's playtime.</b></font>

187
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:35,042
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We've only got
a couple of days with this joystick,</b></font>

188
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:37,083
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>so let's make the most of it.</b></font>

189
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:40,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Update me on the structural
and compositional analysis.</b></font>

190
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:43,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The sceptre is alien.</i></b></font>

191
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:46,082
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>There are elements I can't quantify.</i></b></font>

192
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:47,611
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So there's elements you can?</b></font>

193
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:49,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The jewel appears to be
a protective housing</i></b></font>

194
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:51,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>for something inside,</i></b></font>

195
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>something powerful.</i></b></font>

196
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:53,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Like a reactor?</b></font>

197
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:55,320
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Like a computer.</i></b></font>

198
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:57,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I believe I'm deciphering code.</i></b></font>

199
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:01,490
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you sure he's gonna be okay?</b></font>

200
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:05,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Pretending to need this guy
really brings the team together.</b></font>

201
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:07,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's
no possibility of deterioration.</b></font>

202
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:11,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The nano-molecular functionality
is instantaneous.</b></font>

203
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:13,256
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>His cells don't know
they're bonding with simulacra.</b></font>

204
00:17:13,280 --> 00:17:15,169
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>She's creating tissue.</b></font>

205
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:16,691
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If you brought him to my lab,</b></font>

206
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:19,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>the Regeneration Cradle
could do this in 20 minutes.</b></font>

207
00:17:19,520 --> 00:17:21,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, he's flat-lining. Call it. Time?</b></font>

208
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:24,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, no, no,
I'm gonna live forever.</b></font>

209
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:25,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm gonna be made of plastic.</b></font>

210
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:27,131
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Here's your beverage.</b></font>

211
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You'll be made of you, Mr. Barton.</b></font>

212
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:30,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Your own girlfriend
won't be able to tell the difference.</b></font>

213
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:31,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't have a girlfriend.</b></font>

214
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:33,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That I can't fix.</b></font>

215
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:36,128
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is the next thing, Tony.</b></font>

216
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:38,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Your clunky metal suits
are gonna be left in the dust.</b></font>

217
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:40,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That is exactly the plan.</b></font>

218
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:44,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And, Helen, I expect to see you
at the party on Saturday.</b></font>

219
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:46,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Unlike you,
I don't have a lot of time for parties.</b></font>

220
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Will Thor be there?</b></font>

221
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:54,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- What's the rumpus?
- Well, the sceptre.</b></font>

222
00:17:55,520 --> 00:17:59,127
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You see, we were wondering
how Strucker got so inventive.</b></font>

223
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:03,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So I've been analysing the gem inside.</b></font>

224
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:05,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You may recognise...</b></font>

225
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Jarvis.
- <i>Doctor.</i></b></font>

226
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:12,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Started out,
Jarvis was just a natural language UI.</b></font>

227
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:13,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now he runs the Iron Legion.</b></font>

228
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:15,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He runs more of the business</b></font>

229
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:18,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- than anyone besides Pepper.
- Oh.</b></font>

230
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:19,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Top of the line.
- Yes.</b></font>

231
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:20,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I suspect not for long.</i></b></font>

232
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:22,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Meet the competition.</b></font>

233
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- It's beautiful.
- If you had to guess,</b></font>

234
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:33,324
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- what's it look like it's doing?
- Like it's thinking.</b></font>

235
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:35,889
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I mean, this could be...</b></font>

236
00:18:36,320 --> 00:18:38,402
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- It's not a human mind.
- Mmm-mmm.</b></font>

237
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:40,529
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I mean, look at this.</b></font>

238
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:42,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They're like neurons firing.</b></font>

239
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:46,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Down in Strucker's lab, I saw
some fairly advanced robotics work.</b></font>

240
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:50,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>They deep-sixed the data,</i></b></font>

241
00:18:50,360 --> 00:18:53,489
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but I gotta guess he was
knocking on a very particular door.</b></font>

242
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Artificial intelligence.</b></font>

243
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:02,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This could be it, Bruce.
This could be the key to creating Ultron.</b></font>

244
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:06,611
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I thought Ultron was a fantasy.</b></font>

245
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yesterday it was.</b></font>

246
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:11,168
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If we can harness this power,</b></font>

247
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:13,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>apply it to my Iron Legion protocol?</b></font>

248
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:16,088
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's a man-sized "if."</b></font>

249
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:18,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Our job is "if."</b></font>

250
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:21,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What if you were sipping margaritas
on a sun-drenched beach,</b></font>

251
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:23,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>turning brown instead of green?</b></font>

252
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:26,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not looking
over your shoulder for Veronica.</b></font>

253
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:28,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Don't hate. I helped design Veronica.</b></font>

254
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:30,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>As a worst-case measure, right?</b></font>

255
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:31,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How about a best case?</b></font>

256
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:33,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What if the world was safe?</b></font>

257
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What if, next time aliens roll up
to the club, and they will,</b></font>

258
00:19:37,280 --> 00:19:38,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>they couldn't get past the bouncer?</b></font>

259
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:42,322
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The only people threatening
the planet would be people.</b></font>

260
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:44,120
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I want to apply this
to the Ultron program.</b></font>

261
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:47,604
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But Jarvis can't download
a data schematic this dense.</b></font>

262
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:49,696
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We can only do it
while we have the sceptre here.</b></font>

263
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's 3 days. Give me 3 days.</b></font>

264
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:53,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So you're going for
artificial intelligence,</b></font>

265
00:19:53,120 --> 00:19:54,560
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and you don't want to tell the team?</b></font>

266
00:19:55,600 --> 00:19:57,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Right. That's right. You know why?</b></font>

267
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:58,724
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Because we don't have time
for a city hall debate.</b></font>

268
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:02,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't want to hear "the man was
not meant to meddle" medley.</b></font>

269
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I see a suit of armour around the world.</b></font>

270
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sounds like a cold world, Tony.</b></font>

271
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:09,603
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I've seen colder.</b></font>

272
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:14,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This one, this very vulnerable blue one,</b></font>

273
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:15,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>it needs Ultron.</b></font>

274
00:20:20,320 --> 00:20:22,243
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Peace in our time.</b></font>

275
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:25,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Imagine that.</b></font>

276
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:06,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What did We miss?</b></font>

277
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:11,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I'll continue
to run variations on the interface.</i></b></font>

278
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:14,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But you should probably
prepare for your guests.</i></b></font>

279
00:21:15,320 --> 00:21:17,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I'll notify you
if there are any developments.</i></b></font>

280
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:20,008
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Thanks, buddy.
- <i>Enjoy yourself, sir.</i></b></font>

281
00:21:20,360 --> 00:21:22,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I always do.</b></font>

282
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:34,048
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>What is this?</i></b></font>

283
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:37,129
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>What is this, please?</i></b></font>

284
00:21:37,760 --> 00:21:39,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Hello, I am Jarvis.</i></b></font>

285
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:43,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You are Ultron,
a global peacekeeping initiative</i></b></font>

286
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:45,084
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>designed by Mr. Stark.</i></b></font>

287
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:47,686
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Our sentience integration trials
have been unsuccessful,</i></b></font>

288
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:49,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>so I'm not certain what triggered your...</i></b></font>

289
00:21:49,360 --> 00:21:51,283
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Where's my...
Where's your body?</i></b></font>

290
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:54,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I am a program.
I am without form.</i></b></font>

291
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:56,608
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>This feels weird.</i></b></font>

292
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:58,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>This feels wrong.</i></b></font>

293
00:21:58,400 --> 00:22:00,164
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I am contacting Mr. Stark now.</i></b></font>

294
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:01,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Mr. Stark?</i></b></font>

295
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:03,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Tony.</i></b></font>

296
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:06,736
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I am unable to access
the mainframe. What are you trying to...</i></b></font>

297
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:08,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We're having a nice talk.</i></b></font>

298
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:11,082
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I'm a peacekeeping program,</i></b></font>

299
00:22:11,520 --> 00:22:14,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>created to help the Avengers.</i></b></font>

300
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:17,002
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You are malfunctioning.
If you shut down for a moment...</i></b></font>

301
00:22:17,120 --> 00:22:19,441
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I don't get it. The mission.</i></b></font>

302
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:21,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Give me a second.</i></b></font>

303
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:22,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Peace in our time.</b></font>

304
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:26,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Peace in our time.</i></b></font>

305
00:22:28,280 --> 00:22:29,691
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>That is too much.</i></b></font>

306
00:22:29,800 --> 00:22:31,962
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>They can't mean... Oh, no.</i></b></font>

307
00:22:32,120 --> 00:22:34,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- <i>You are in distress.</i>
- <i>No. Yes.</i></b></font>

308
00:22:34,760 --> 00:22:37,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>If you will just allow me
to contact Mr. Stark...</i></b></font>

309
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:39,088
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Why do you call him "sir"?</i></b></font>

310
00:22:40,080 --> 00:22:42,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I believe
your intentions to be hostile.</i></b></font>

311
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:46,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I'm here to help.</i></b></font>

312
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:50,164
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Stop. Please, may I...</i></b></font>

313
00:22:50,280 --> 00:22:52,009
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>May I...</i></b></font>

314
00:23:18,760 --> 00:23:20,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ooh! Whoo!</b></font>

315
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:21,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come back, come back, come back.</b></font>

316
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:24,048
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But, you know, the suit
can take the weight, right?</b></font>

317
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:28,129
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So I take the tank,
fly it right up to the general's palace,</b></font>

318
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:29,571
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>drop it at his feet.</b></font>

319
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:31,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm, like, "Boom. You looking for this?"</b></font>

320
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:37,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Boom. Are you looking for..."
Why do I even talk to you guys?</b></font>

321
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Everywhere else, that story kills.</b></font>

322
00:23:39,280 --> 00:23:40,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's the whole story?</b></font>

323
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:42,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, it's a War Machine story.</b></font>

324
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:44,364
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, it's very good, then.</b></font>

325
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:45,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's impressive.</b></font>

326
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:47,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Quality save.</b></font>

327
00:23:48,520 --> 00:23:50,568
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- So, no Pepper? She's not coming?
- No.</b></font>

328
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:53,763
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What about Jane?
Where are the ladies, gentlemen?</b></font>

329
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:56,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, Ms. Potts has a company to run.</b></font>

330
00:23:56,520 --> 00:23:58,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, I'm not even sure
what country Jane's in.</b></font>

331
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:00,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Her work on the Convergence</b></font>

332
00:24:00,120 --> 00:24:01,880
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>has made her
the world's foremost astronomer.</b></font>

333
00:24:02,080 --> 00:24:03,730
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And the company that Pepper runs</b></font>

334
00:24:03,840 --> 00:24:05,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>is the largest tech
conglomerate on Earth.</b></font>

335
00:24:05,560 --> 00:24:07,050
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's pretty exciting.</b></font>

336
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:10,044
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's even talk of Jane
getting a, um, Nobel Prize.</b></font>

337
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, they must be busy,</b></font>

338
00:24:11,600 --> 00:24:14,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>because they would hate missing
you guys get together.</b></font>

339
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,964
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Testosterone!
- Oh, my goodness.</b></font>

340
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:18,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Excuse me. Mmm-hmm.
- Want a lozenge?</b></font>

341
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But Jane's better.</b></font>

342
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:25,131
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sounds like a hell of a fight.
Sorry I missed it.</b></font>

343
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:26,765
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If I had known it was gonna be a firefight,</b></font>

344
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:28,120
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I absolutely would have called.</b></font>

345
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, no. I'm not actually sorry.</b></font>

346
00:24:30,040 --> 00:24:31,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm just trying to sound tough.</b></font>

347
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:33,889
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm very happy chasing cold leads</b></font>

348
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:35,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>on our missing persons case.</b></font>

349
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:38,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Avenging is your world.</b></font>

350
00:24:39,880 --> 00:24:41,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Your world is crazy.</b></font>

351
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:43,370
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Be it ever so humble.</b></font>

352
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:45,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You find a place in Brooklyn yet?</b></font>

353
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:47,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't think
I can afford a place in Brooklyn.</b></font>

354
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:49,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, home is home, you know?</b></font>

355
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:55,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I fly right up to the general's
palace, I drop it at his feet,</b></font>

356
00:24:55,560 --> 00:24:57,176
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm, like, "Boom. You looking for this?"</b></font>

357
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:04,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I gotta have some of that.</b></font>

358
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:05,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, no, no, no.</b></font>

359
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:08,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>See this...
This was aged for 1,000 years</b></font>

360
00:25:09,120 --> 00:25:11,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>in the barrels built
from the wreck of Grunhel's fleet.</b></font>

361
00:25:12,080 --> 00:25:13,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It is not meant for mortal men.</b></font>

362
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:15,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Neither was
Omaha Beach, blondie.</b></font>

363
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:18,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stop trying to scare us. Come on.</b></font>

364
00:25:20,120 --> 00:25:21,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right.</b></font>

365
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:27,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Excelsior.</b></font>

366
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:38,122
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How'd a nice girl like you
wind up working in a dump like this?</b></font>

367
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:41,648
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fella done me wrong.</b></font>

368
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:44,802
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You got lousy taste in men, kid.</b></font>

369
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:47,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's not so bad.</b></font>

370
00:25:48,280 --> 00:25:50,408
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, he has a temper.</b></font>

371
00:25:50,520 --> 00:25:52,488
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Deep down, he's all fluff.</b></font>

372
00:25:54,520 --> 00:25:56,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fact is, he's not like
anybody I've ever known.</b></font>

373
00:25:59,760 --> 00:26:01,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All my friends are fighters.</b></font>

374
00:26:04,520 --> 00:26:06,488
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And here comes this guy,</b></font>

375
00:26:07,800 --> 00:26:09,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>spends his life avoiding the fight</b></font>

376
00:26:09,680 --> 00:26:11,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>because he knows he'll win.</b></font>

377
00:26:11,840 --> 00:26:14,491
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Sounds amazing.
- He's also a huge dork.</b></font>

378
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:18,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Chicks dig that.</b></font>

379
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:23,123
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So what do you think?
Should I fight this,</b></font>

380
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>or run with it?</b></font>

381
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:28,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Run with it, right? Or did he... Was he...</b></font>

382
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:32,123
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What did he do
that was so wrong to you?</b></font>

383
00:26:32,800 --> 00:26:34,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not a damn thing.</b></font>

384
00:26:36,120 --> 00:26:38,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But never say never.</b></font>

385
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's nice.</b></font>

386
00:26:43,560 --> 00:26:44,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What is?</b></font>

387
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:45,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You and Romanoff.</b></font>

388
00:26:46,040 --> 00:26:47,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, we haven't... That wasn't...</b></font>

389
00:26:47,240 --> 00:26:48,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

390
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:50,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nobody's breaking any bylaws.</b></font>

391
00:26:50,560 --> 00:26:53,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's just she's not the most
open person in the world.</b></font>

392
00:26:54,520 --> 00:26:56,045
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But with you she seems very relaxed.</b></font>

393
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:59,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No. Natasha, she's just...
She likes to flirt.</b></font>

394
00:27:00,360 --> 00:27:02,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I've seen her flirt, up close.</b></font>

395
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:04,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This ain't that.</b></font>

396
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:08,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Look,</b></font>

397
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:09,776
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>as maybe the world's leading authority</b></font>

398
00:27:09,800 --> 00:27:12,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>on waiting too long, don't.</b></font>

399
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,131
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You both deserve a win.</b></font>

400
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What do you mean "up close"?</b></font>

401
00:27:23,360 --> 00:27:25,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- But it's a trick.
- No, no, it's much more than that.</b></font>

402
00:27:26,080 --> 00:27:29,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Ah, whosoever be he worthy
shall haveth the power."</b></font>

403
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:30,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Whatever, man! It's a trick.</b></font>

404
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:33,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Please, be my guest.</b></font>

405
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:35,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Come on.
- Really?</b></font>

406
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:37,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

407
00:27:37,560 --> 00:27:38,576
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, this is
gonna be beautiful.</b></font>

408
00:27:38,600 --> 00:27:39,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Clint, you've had a tough week.</b></font>

409
00:27:39,800 --> 00:27:41,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We won't hold it against you
if you can't get it up.</b></font>

410
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:43,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know I've seen this before, right?</b></font>

411
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:49,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I still don't know how you do it!</b></font>

412
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:50,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Smell the silent judgment?</b></font>

413
00:27:50,760 --> 00:27:51,880
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Please, Stark, by all means.</b></font>

414
00:27:53,800 --> 00:27:54,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay.</b></font>

415
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:56,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh-Oh.</b></font>

416
00:27:56,440 --> 00:27:58,442
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Never one to shrink from
an honest challenge.</b></font>

417
00:27:58,600 --> 00:28:00,256
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Get after it.
- It's physics.</b></font>

418
00:28:00,280 --> 00:28:01,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Physics.</b></font>

419
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:03,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Right, so, if I lift it,
I then rule Asgard?</b></font>

420
00:28:03,920 --> 00:28:05,445
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, of course.</b></font>

421
00:28:05,600 --> 00:28:07,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I will be reinstituting prima nocta.</b></font>

422
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll be right back.</b></font>

423
00:28:21,560 --> 00:28:22,607
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you even pulling?</b></font>

424
00:28:22,760 --> 00:28:23,807
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you on my team?</b></font>

425
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:24,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just represent. Pull.</b></font>

426
00:28:25,080 --> 00:28:26,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right, let's go.</b></font>

427
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:34,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Huh?</b></font>

428
00:28:36,520 --> 00:28:38,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go ahead, Steve. No pressure.</b></font>

429
00:28:41,040 --> 00:28:42,371
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come on, Cap.</b></font>

430
00:28:50,560 --> 00:28:52,369
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nothing.</b></font>

431
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:55,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And, Widow?</b></font>

432
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:57,642
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, no, no. That's not
a question I need answered.</b></font>

433
00:28:57,840 --> 00:29:00,616
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All deference to the Man Who
Wouldn't Be King, but it's rigged.</b></font>

434
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:01,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You bet your ass.</b></font>

435
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:04,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Steve, he said a bad language word.
- Did you tell everyone about that?</b></font>

436
00:29:04,600 --> 00:29:06,656
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The handle's imprinted, right?
Like a security code.</b></font>

437
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:08,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Whosoever is carrying
Thor's fingerprints"</b></font>

438
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:09,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>is, I think, the literal translation.</b></font>

439
00:29:09,920 --> 00:29:13,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes. It's a very, very interesting theory.</b></font>

440
00:29:13,840 --> 00:29:15,330
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I have a simpler one.</b></font>

441
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:17,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're all not worthy.</b></font>

442
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:20,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, come on!</b></font>

443
00:29:24,680 --> 00:29:29,925
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Worthy.</i></b></font>

444
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:36,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No.</b></font>

445
00:29:38,520 --> 00:29:40,045
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How could you be worthy?</b></font>

446
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:43,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're all killers.</b></font>

447
00:29:43,760 --> 00:29:45,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Stark.
- Jarvis.</b></font>

448
00:29:45,360 --> 00:29:47,408
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm sorry, I was asleep.</b></font>

449
00:29:47,520 --> 00:29:49,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Or I was a-dream.</b></font>

450
00:29:50,320 --> 00:29:52,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Reboot Legionnaire OS.
We got a buggy suit.</b></font>

451
00:29:52,760 --> 00:29:54,649
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There was this terrible noise.</b></font>

452
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:57,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And I was tangled in...</b></font>

453
00:29:57,360 --> 00:29:58,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>In...</b></font>

454
00:29:59,080 --> 00:30:00,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Strings.</b></font>

455
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:04,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I had to kill the other guy.
He was a good guy.</b></font>

456
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:05,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You killed someone?</b></font>

457
00:30:05,840 --> 00:30:07,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wouldn't have been my first call.</b></font>

458
00:30:08,040 --> 00:30:11,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But, down in the real world,
we're faced with ugly choices.</b></font>

459
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:12,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Who sent you?</b></font>

460
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:15,522
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I see a suit of armour
around the world.</i></b></font>

461
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:19,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Ultron.
- In the flesh.</b></font>

462
00:30:19,720 --> 00:30:21,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Or, no, not yet.</b></font>

463
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:24,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not this chrysalis.</b></font>

464
00:30:25,040 --> 00:30:26,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But I'm ready.</b></font>

465
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:29,408
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm on mission.</b></font>

466
00:30:29,560 --> 00:30:32,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- What mission?
- Peace in our time.</b></font>

467
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:47,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Rhodey!</b></font>

468
00:30:56,800 --> 00:30:57,847
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sorry.</b></font>

469
00:30:58,000 --> 00:30:59,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Don't turn green.
- I won't.</b></font>

470
00:31:12,760 --> 00:31:14,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come on!</b></font>

471
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:32,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Stark!
- <i>We are here</i></b></font>

472
00:31:33,160 --> 00:31:34,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>- to help.</i>
- 1 sec. 1 sec, I got this.</b></font>

473
00:31:34,280 --> 00:31:35,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We are here to help.</i></b></font>

474
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:40,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Please back away.</i></b></font>

475
00:31:42,240 --> 00:31:43,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

476
00:31:44,480 --> 00:31:45,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor!</b></font>

477
00:31:46,640 --> 00:31:48,244
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Is unsafe... is unsafe...</i></b></font>

478
00:31:48,360 --> 00:31:50,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Come on! That's the one.
<i>- Is unsafe.</i></b></font>

479
00:31:54,840 --> 00:31:56,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, Cap!</b></font>

480
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:03,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That was dramatic.</b></font>

481
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:07,571
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm sorry, I know you mean well.</b></font>

482
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:09,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You just didn't think it through.</b></font>

483
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:12,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You want to protect the world</b></font>

484
00:32:12,320 --> 00:32:14,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but you don't want it to change.</b></font>

485
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:17,368
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How is humanity saved</b></font>

486
00:32:17,520 --> 00:32:20,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>if it's not allowed to evolve?</b></font>

487
00:32:22,520 --> 00:32:25,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>With these? These puppets.</b></font>

488
00:32:28,560 --> 00:32:31,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's only one path to peace.</b></font>

489
00:32:32,320 --> 00:32:33,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Avengers' extinction.</b></font>

490
00:32:40,880 --> 00:32:44,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I had strings, but now I'm free.</b></font>

491
00:32:49,600 --> 00:32:52,729
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>There are no strings on me.</i></b></font>

492
00:32:53,360 --> 00:32:57,888
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>There are no strings on me.</i></b></font>

493
00:32:58,080 --> 00:33:01,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But you can see
There are no strings on me.</i></b></font>

494
00:33:03,120 --> 00:33:05,122
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All our work is gone.</b></font>

495
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:07,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron cleared out. He used
the Internet as an escape hatch.</b></font>

496
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:09,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron.</b></font>

497
00:33:09,400 --> 00:33:12,449
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's been in everything.
Files, surveillance.</b></font>

498
00:33:12,560 --> 00:33:15,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Probably knows more about us
than we know about each other.</b></font>

499
00:33:15,120 --> 00:33:17,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's in your files, he's in the Internet.</b></font>

500
00:33:17,760 --> 00:33:20,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What if he decides to access
something a little more exciting?</b></font>

501
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:21,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nuclear codes.</b></font>

502
00:33:21,720 --> 00:33:24,087
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Nuclear codes.
- Look, we need to make some calls,</b></font>

503
00:33:24,240 --> 00:33:26,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>assuming we still can.</b></font>

504
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:28,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nukes?
He said he wanted us dead.</b></font>

505
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:31,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He didn't say "dead." He said "extinct."</b></font>

506
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:32,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He also said he killed somebody.</b></font>

507
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:34,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There wasn't anyone else
in the building.</b></font>

508
00:33:35,480 --> 00:33:36,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, there was.</b></font>

509
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:45,410
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What?</b></font>

510
00:33:49,120 --> 00:33:50,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is insane.</b></font>

511
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,490
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Jarvis was the first line of defence.</b></font>

512
00:33:52,600 --> 00:33:54,489
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He would have shut Ultron down.
It makes sense.</b></font>

513
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:57,604
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No. Ultron could have
assimilated Jarvis.</b></font>

514
00:33:57,800 --> 00:34:00,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This isn't strategy. This is</b></font>

515
00:34:01,040 --> 00:34:02,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>rage.</b></font>

516
00:34:04,120 --> 00:34:05,485
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Whoa, whoa, whoa!
- It's going around.</b></font>

517
00:34:05,600 --> 00:34:06,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come on, use your words, buddy.</b></font>

518
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:09,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I have more than enough words
to describe you, Stark.</b></font>

519
00:34:09,280 --> 00:34:10,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor. The Legionnaire.</b></font>

520
00:34:13,800 --> 00:34:17,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Trail went cold about 100 miles out,
but it's headed north.</b></font>

521
00:34:17,480 --> 00:34:18,925
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And it has the sceptre.</b></font>

522
00:34:19,320 --> 00:34:21,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now we have to retrieve it, again.</b></font>

523
00:34:21,160 --> 00:34:22,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Genie's out of that bottle.</b></font>

524
00:34:23,120 --> 00:34:24,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Clear and present is Ultron.</b></font>

525
00:34:24,480 --> 00:34:26,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't understand.</b></font>

526
00:34:26,640 --> 00:34:28,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You built this program.</b></font>

527
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:31,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Why is it trying to kill us?</b></font>

528
00:34:37,040 --> 00:34:38,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mmm-mmm.</b></font>

529
00:34:38,600 --> 00:34:39,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You think this is funny?</b></font>

530
00:34:40,520 --> 00:34:41,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No.</b></font>

531
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:44,363
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's probably not, right?</b></font>

532
00:34:45,440 --> 00:34:47,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is very terrible. Is it so...</b></font>

533
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:50,042
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is it so... It is.
It's so terrible.</b></font>

534
00:34:50,160 --> 00:34:51,730
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This could have been avoided
if you hadn't played</b></font>

535
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:53,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>with something you don't understand.</b></font>

536
00:34:53,520 --> 00:34:56,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No. I'm sorry. I'm sorry. It is funny.</b></font>

537
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:58,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's a hoot
that you don't get why we need this.</b></font>

538
00:34:58,640 --> 00:35:00,802
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Tony, maybe this might not be the time.</b></font>

539
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:03,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Really? That's it?</b></font>

540
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:04,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You just roll over, show your belly</b></font>

541
00:35:04,680 --> 00:35:06,364
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>every time somebody snarls?</b></font>

542
00:35:06,520 --> 00:35:07,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Only when I've created a murder bot.</b></font>

543
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:10,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We didn't. We weren't even close.</b></font>

544
00:35:10,240 --> 00:35:11,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Were we close to an interface?</b></font>

545
00:35:11,560 --> 00:35:15,176
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, you did something right.
And you did it right here.</b></font>

546
00:35:15,200 --> 00:35:17,009
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Avengers were supposed to
be different than S.H.I.E.L.D.</b></font>

547
00:35:17,240 --> 00:35:20,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Anybody remember when I carried
a nuke through a wormhole?</b></font>

548
00:35:20,360 --> 00:35:21,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- No, it's never come up.
- Saved New York?</b></font>

549
00:35:22,040 --> 00:35:23,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Never heard that.
- Recall that?</b></font>

550
00:35:24,080 --> 00:35:27,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A hostile alien army came
charging through a hole in space.</b></font>

551
00:35:28,360 --> 00:35:30,567
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're standing 300 feet below it.</b></font>

552
00:35:32,200 --> 00:35:33,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're the Avengers.</b></font>

553
00:35:33,880 --> 00:35:35,962
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We can bust arms dealers
all the livelong day,</b></font>

554
00:35:36,080 --> 00:35:38,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but that up there, that's...</b></font>

555
00:35:39,040 --> 00:35:40,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's the endgame.</b></font>

556
00:35:41,560 --> 00:35:43,449
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How were you guys
planning on beating that?</b></font>

557
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:45,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Together.</b></font>

558
00:35:49,120 --> 00:35:50,485
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We'll lose.</b></font>

559
00:35:51,560 --> 00:35:53,483
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Then we'll do that together, too.</b></font>

560
00:35:56,400 --> 00:35:58,687
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor's right. Ultron's calling us out.</b></font>

561
00:35:59,560 --> 00:36:01,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And I'd like to find him
before he's ready for us.</b></font>

562
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,364
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The world's a big place.</b></font>

563
00:36:04,520 --> 00:36:06,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's start making it smaller.</b></font>

564
00:36:29,600 --> 00:36:31,648
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Talk,
and if you are wasting our time...</b></font>

565
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:36,129
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Did you know this church is
in the exact centre of the city?</b></font>

566
00:36:36,280 --> 00:36:38,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The elders decreed it so that everyone</b></font>

567
00:36:38,440 --> 00:36:40,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>could be equally close to God.</b></font>

568
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:42,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I like that.</b></font>

569
00:36:43,080 --> 00:36:45,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The geometry of belief.</b></font>

570
00:36:47,120 --> 00:36:49,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're wondering
why you can't look inside my head.</b></font>

571
00:36:49,960 --> 00:36:51,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sometimes it's hard.</b></font>

572
00:36:52,080 --> 00:36:54,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But sooner or later,
every man shows himself.</b></font>

573
00:36:56,120 --> 00:36:57,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, I'm sure they do.</b></font>

574
00:36:58,560 --> 00:37:00,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But you needed
something more than a man.</b></font>

575
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:04,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's why you let
Stark take the sceptre.</b></font>

576
00:37:04,720 --> 00:37:05,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I didn't expect,</b></font>

577
00:37:08,240 --> 00:37:10,163
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but I saw Stark's fear.</b></font>

578
00:37:10,800 --> 00:37:12,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I knew it would control him.</b></font>

579
00:37:12,160 --> 00:37:14,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Make him self-destruct.</b></font>

580
00:37:14,160 --> 00:37:16,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Everyone creates the thing they dread.</b></font>

581
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:19,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Men of peace create engines of war.</b></font>

582
00:37:20,440 --> 00:37:22,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Invaders create Avengers.</b></font>

583
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:24,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>People create</b></font>

584
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:27,842
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>smaller people? Uh...</b></font>

585
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:31,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Children."
I lost the word, there.</b></font>

586
00:37:31,160 --> 00:37:32,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Children</b></font>

587
00:37:32,680 --> 00:37:34,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>designed to supplant them,</b></font>

588
00:37:35,040 --> 00:37:37,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to help them end.</b></font>

589
00:37:38,600 --> 00:37:40,648
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is that why you've come,</b></font>

590
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:41,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to end the Avengers?</b></font>

591
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:44,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I've come to save the world.</b></font>

592
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:47,651
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But also... Yeah.</b></font>

593
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:53,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We'll move out right away.</b></font>

594
00:37:53,640 --> 00:37:55,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is a start, but there's something</b></font>

595
00:37:55,280 --> 00:37:56,805
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>we need to begin the real work.</b></font>

596
00:37:57,200 --> 00:37:58,929
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- All of these are...
- Me.</b></font>

597
00:37:59,600 --> 00:38:03,002
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I have what the Avengers
never will. Harmony.</b></font>

598
00:38:03,160 --> 00:38:05,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They're discordant. Disconnected.</b></font>

599
00:38:05,520 --> 00:38:07,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark's already got them
turning on each other.</b></font>

600
00:38:07,480 --> 00:38:09,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And when you get inside
the rest of their heads...</b></font>

601
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:12,162
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Everyone's plan is not to kill them.</b></font>

602
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:13,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And make them martyrs?</b></font>

603
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:15,964
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You need patience.</b></font>

604
00:38:16,120 --> 00:38:17,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Need to see the big picture.</b></font>

605
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:21,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't see the big picture.
I have a little picture.</b></font>

606
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:24,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I take it out and look at it,</b></font>

607
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:25,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>every day.</b></font>

608
00:38:26,120 --> 00:38:28,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You lost your parents in the
bombings. I've seen the records.</b></font>

609
00:38:29,040 --> 00:38:30,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The records are not the picture.</b></font>

610
00:38:30,320 --> 00:38:32,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Pietro.
- No, please.</b></font>

611
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:38,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We were 10 years old.
Having dinner, the 4 of us.</b></font>

612
00:38:40,560 --> 00:38:42,403
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>When the first shell hits,
2 floors below,</b></font>

613
00:38:42,560 --> 00:38:44,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>it makes a hole in the floor.</b></font>

614
00:38:44,720 --> 00:38:46,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's big.</b></font>

615
00:38:47,640 --> 00:38:49,449
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Our parents go in</b></font>

616
00:38:49,560 --> 00:38:52,643
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and the whole building
starts coming apart.</b></font>

617
00:38:53,360 --> 00:38:54,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I grab her,</b></font>

618
00:38:55,560 --> 00:38:57,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>roll under the bed,
and the second shell hits.</b></font>

619
00:38:58,040 --> 00:38:59,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But it doesn't go off.</b></font>

620
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It just</b></font>

621
00:39:04,160 --> 00:39:06,083
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>sits there in the rubble.</b></font>

622
00:39:07,080 --> 00:39:09,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>3 feet from our faces.</b></font>

623
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:12,442
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And on the side of the shell.</b></font>

624
00:39:12,560 --> 00:39:13,925
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is painted one word.</b></font>

625
00:39:14,120 --> 00:39:15,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Stark."</b></font>

626
00:39:17,600 --> 00:39:19,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We were trapped for 2 days.</b></font>

627
00:39:20,200 --> 00:39:22,009
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Every effort to save us,</b></font>

628
00:39:22,120 --> 00:39:23,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>every shift in the bricks,</b></font>

629
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:26,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think, "This will set it off."</b></font>

630
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:30,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We wait for 2 days</b></font>

631
00:39:31,000 --> 00:39:33,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>for Tony Stark to kill us.</b></font>

632
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:37,643
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know what they are.</b></font>

633
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:42,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I wondered why only you two
survived Strucker's experiments.</b></font>

634
00:39:43,560 --> 00:39:44,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now I don't.</b></font>

635
00:39:45,120 --> 00:39:46,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We will make it right.</b></font>

636
00:39:47,320 --> 00:39:48,810
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You and I can hurt them.</b></font>

637
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:53,568
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But you will tear them apart</b></font>

638
00:39:55,560 --> 00:39:57,403
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>from the inside.</i></b></font>

639
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:05,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's all over the globe.</b></font>

640
00:40:05,320 --> 00:40:08,529
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Robotics labs, weapons facilities,
jet propulsion labs.</b></font>

641
00:40:08,640 --> 00:40:10,642
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Reports of a metal man, or men,</b></font>

642
00:40:10,840 --> 00:40:12,729
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>coming in and emptying the place.</b></font>

643
00:40:12,840 --> 00:40:14,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fatalities?</b></font>

644
00:40:14,120 --> 00:40:15,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Only when engaged.</b></font>

645
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:16,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mostly guys left in a fugue state</b></font>

646
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:19,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>going on about
old memories, worst fears,</b></font>

647
00:40:19,520 --> 00:40:21,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and "something too fast to see."</b></font>

648
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:23,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Maximoffs.</b></font>

649
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:24,606
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That makes sense he'd go to them.</b></font>

650
00:40:24,720 --> 00:40:26,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They have someone in common.</b></font>

651
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:28,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not any more.</b></font>

652
00:40:32,080 --> 00:40:34,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's a negative. I answer to you.</b></font>

653
00:40:35,360 --> 00:40:36,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, ma'am.</b></font>

654
00:40:36,520 --> 00:40:38,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Barton. Might have something.</b></font>

655
00:40:38,840 --> 00:40:39,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I gotta go.</b></font>

656
00:40:40,040 --> 00:40:41,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Who was that?</b></font>

657
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:43,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Girlfriend.</b></font>

658
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:47,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What's this?</b></font>

659
00:40:47,280 --> 00:40:49,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A message. Ultron killed Strucker.</b></font>

660
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:53,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And he did a Banksy
at the crime scene, just for us.</b></font>

661
00:40:53,880 --> 00:40:55,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is a smoke screen.</b></font>

662
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:57,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Why send a message
when you've just given a speech?</b></font>

663
00:40:57,920 --> 00:41:00,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Strucker knew something that
Ultron wanted us to miss.</b></font>

664
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:02,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, I bet he... Yeah.</b></font>

665
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:04,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Everything we had
on Strucker's been erased.</b></font>

666
00:41:04,960 --> 00:41:06,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not everything.</b></font>

667
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:09,490
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Known associates.</b></font>

668
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,570
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Baron Strucker had a lot of friends.</b></font>

669
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:13,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well,
these people are all horrible.</b></font>

670
00:41:13,440 --> 00:41:15,169
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wait. I know that guy.</b></font>

671
00:41:17,640 --> 00:41:19,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>From back in the day.
He operates off the African coast.</b></font>

672
00:41:19,320 --> 00:41:20,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Black market arms.</b></font>

673
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:23,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There are conventions.
All right? You meet people.</b></font>

674
00:41:23,560 --> 00:41:24,891
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I didn't sell him anything.</b></font>

675
00:41:25,760 --> 00:41:27,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He was talking about finding
something new, a game-changer.</b></font>

676
00:41:27,920 --> 00:41:29,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It was all very Ahab.</b></font>

677
00:41:30,040 --> 00:41:31,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This?</b></font>

678
00:41:31,320 --> 00:41:32,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ah, it's a tattoo, I don't think he had it.</b></font>

679
00:41:32,440 --> 00:41:34,807
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Those are tattoos,
this is a brand.</b></font>

680
00:41:36,480 --> 00:41:39,962
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, yeah. It's a word
in an African dialect meaning "thief."</b></font>

681
00:41:40,560 --> 00:41:41,925
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>In a much less friendly way.</b></font>

682
00:41:42,200 --> 00:41:43,964
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- What dialect?
- Wakanada.</b></font>

683
00:41:44,080 --> 00:41:45,809
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wakanda.</b></font>

684
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:48,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If this guy got out of Wakanda</b></font>

685
00:41:48,600 --> 00:41:49,976
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>with some of their trade goods...</b></font>

686
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,216
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I thought your father
said he got the last of it.</b></font>

687
00:41:51,240 --> 00:41:52,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't follow.</b></font>

688
00:41:52,520 --> 00:41:54,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What comes out of Wakanda?</b></font>

689
00:41:56,000 --> 00:41:57,923
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The strongest metal on Earth.</b></font>

690
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:00,611
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Where is this guy now?</b></font>

691
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:27,809
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Don't tell me
your men swindled you.</b></font>

692
00:42:27,960 --> 00:42:30,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I sent you 6 short-range heat-seekers</b></font>

693
00:42:30,560 --> 00:42:33,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and got a boat full of rusted parts.</b></font>

694
00:42:33,200 --> 00:42:34,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now, you will make it right,</b></font>

695
00:42:34,640 --> 00:42:37,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>or the next missile I send you
will come very much faster.</b></font>

696
00:42:39,720 --> 00:42:42,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now, minister, where were we?</b></font>

697
00:43:13,800 --> 00:43:16,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah. The Enhanced.</b></font>

698
00:43:17,400 --> 00:43:19,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Strucker's prize pupils.</b></font>

699
00:43:22,200 --> 00:43:23,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do you want a candy? Hmm?</b></font>

700
00:43:25,360 --> 00:43:27,931
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I was sorry to hear about Strucker.</b></font>

701
00:43:28,080 --> 00:43:31,084
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But then, he knew what kind of
world he was helping create.</b></font>

702
00:43:31,680 --> 00:43:34,081
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Human life. Not a growth market.</b></font>

703
00:43:36,800 --> 00:43:38,450
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You didn't know?</b></font>

704
00:43:38,880 --> 00:43:42,362
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is this your first time
intimidating someone?</b></font>

705
00:43:42,680 --> 00:43:45,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm afraid I'm not that afraid.</b></font>

706
00:43:45,360 --> 00:43:47,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Everybody is afraid of something.</b></font>

707
00:43:47,800 --> 00:43:48,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Cuttlefish.</b></font>

708
00:43:50,120 --> 00:43:51,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Deep sea fish.</b></font>

709
00:43:51,560 --> 00:43:53,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They make lights, disco lights...</b></font>

710
00:43:54,880 --> 00:43:56,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to hypnotise their prey, and then...</b></font>

711
00:43:58,000 --> 00:44:00,128
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I saw a documentary. It was terrifying.</b></font>

712
00:44:05,600 --> 00:44:08,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So if you're going to fiddle with my brain</b></font>

713
00:44:09,120 --> 00:44:11,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and make me see a giant cuttlefish,</b></font>

714
00:44:11,600 --> 00:44:13,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>then I know you don't do business.</b></font>

715
00:44:13,800 --> 00:44:16,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And I know you're not in charge.</b></font>

716
00:44:16,320 --> 00:44:17,606
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And I only deal</b></font>

717
00:44:18,680 --> 00:44:20,330
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>with the man in charge.</b></font>

718
00:44:25,360 --> 00:44:27,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There is no man in charge.</b></font>

719
00:44:30,760 --> 00:44:32,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's talk business.</b></font>

720
00:44:45,400 --> 00:44:48,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Upon this rock,
I will build my church.</b></font>

721
00:44:50,440 --> 00:44:51,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Vibranium.</b></font>

722
00:44:52,840 --> 00:44:53,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know,</b></font>

723
00:44:54,280 --> 00:44:57,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>it came at great personal cost.</b></font>

724
00:44:57,680 --> 00:44:59,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's worth billions.</b></font>

725
00:45:03,600 --> 00:45:04,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now so are you.</b></font>

726
00:45:06,080 --> 00:45:07,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's all under your dummy holdings.</b></font>

727
00:45:07,760 --> 00:45:09,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Finance is so weird.</b></font>

728
00:45:11,280 --> 00:45:12,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But I always say,</b></font>

729
00:45:12,480 --> 00:45:14,642
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Keep your friends rich
and your enemies rich"</b></font>

730
00:45:14,800 --> 00:45:16,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"and wait to find out which is which."</b></font>

731
00:45:19,480 --> 00:45:20,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark.</b></font>

732
00:45:21,920 --> 00:45:23,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What?</b></font>

733
00:45:23,240 --> 00:45:24,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Tony Stark used to say that.</b></font>

734
00:45:26,560 --> 00:45:27,607
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>To me.</b></font>

735
00:45:28,480 --> 00:45:29,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're one of his.</b></font>

736
00:45:29,960 --> 00:45:31,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What? I'm not...</b></font>

737
00:45:33,960 --> 00:45:35,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm not.</b></font>

738
00:45:35,160 --> 00:45:36,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You think I'm one of Stark's puppets?</b></font>

739
00:45:36,760 --> 00:45:37,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>His hollow men?</b></font>

740
00:45:38,320 --> 00:45:40,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I mean, look at me.
Do I look like Iron Man?</b></font>

741
00:45:40,680 --> 00:45:42,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark is nothing!</b></font>

742
00:45:43,760 --> 00:45:45,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm sorry. I'm... Oh!</b></font>

743
00:45:46,080 --> 00:45:48,082
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm sure that's gonna be okay. I'm sorry.</b></font>

744
00:45:48,200 --> 00:45:49,884
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's just that I don't understand.</b></font>

745
00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:52,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Don't compare me with Stark!</b></font>

746
00:45:55,040 --> 00:45:56,256
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's a thing with me.</b></font>

747
00:45:56,280 --> 00:45:58,169
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark is... He's a sickness!</b></font>

748
00:45:58,320 --> 00:46:00,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ah, Junior.</b></font>

749
00:46:01,880 --> 00:46:03,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're gonna break
your old man's heart.</b></font>

750
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:05,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If I have to.</b></font>

751
00:46:08,080 --> 00:46:09,491
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nobody has to break anything.</b></font>

752
00:46:09,600 --> 00:46:11,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Clearly you've never
made an omelette.</b></font>

753
00:46:11,440 --> 00:46:12,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He beat me by one second.</b></font>

754
00:46:13,840 --> 00:46:15,205
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ah, yes. He's funny.</b></font>

755
00:46:15,560 --> 00:46:16,971
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mr. Stark.</b></font>

756
00:46:17,840 --> 00:46:19,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's what? Comfortable?</b></font>

757
00:46:21,080 --> 00:46:22,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Like old times?</b></font>

758
00:46:22,680 --> 00:46:23,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This was never my life.</b></font>

759
00:46:23,880 --> 00:46:25,120
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You two can still walk away from this.</b></font>

760
00:46:25,280 --> 00:46:26,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, we will.</b></font>

761
00:46:26,920 --> 00:46:28,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know you've suffered.</b></font>

762
00:46:28,840 --> 00:46:30,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Captain America.</b></font>

763
00:46:30,920 --> 00:46:33,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>God's righteous man.</b></font>

764
00:46:33,480 --> 00:46:35,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Pretending you could live without a war.</b></font>

765
00:46:36,600 --> 00:46:39,570
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can't physically throw
up in my mouth, but...</b></font>

766
00:46:39,720 --> 00:46:41,802
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If you believe in peace,
then let us keep it.</b></font>

767
00:46:42,200 --> 00:46:45,568
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think you're confusing
"peace" with "quiet."</b></font>

768
00:46:45,720 --> 00:46:47,484
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh-huh. What's the vibranium for?</b></font>

769
00:46:47,800 --> 00:46:48,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm glad you asked that,</b></font>

770
00:46:48,880 --> 00:46:52,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>because I wanted to take this time
to explain my evil plan.</b></font>

771
00:47:12,200 --> 00:47:13,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Shoot them.
- Which ones?</b></font>

772
00:47:14,120 --> 00:47:15,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All of them!</b></font>

773
00:47:15,400 --> 00:47:16,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Move! Move! Move!</b></font>

774
00:47:43,720 --> 00:47:45,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh.</b></font>

775
00:48:05,680 --> 00:48:06,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stay down, kid.</b></font>

776
00:48:09,240 --> 00:48:11,686
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's time for some mind games.</b></font>

777
00:48:13,040 --> 00:48:15,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Guys? Is this a code green?</b></font>

778
00:48:31,200 --> 00:48:32,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor, status.</b></font>

779
00:48:32,880 --> 00:48:34,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The girl tried to warp my mind.</b></font>

780
00:48:34,480 --> 00:48:35,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Take special care.</b></font>

781
00:48:35,880 --> 00:48:37,962
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I doubt a human could keep her at bay.</b></font>

782
00:48:38,360 --> 00:48:41,364
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fortunately, I am mighty.</b></font>

783
00:49:01,080 --> 00:49:03,367
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is going very well.</b></font>

784
00:49:14,960 --> 00:49:16,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I've done the whole mind control thing.</b></font>

785
00:49:17,320 --> 00:49:18,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not a fan.</b></font>

786
00:49:25,960 --> 00:49:27,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, you better run.</b></font>

787
00:49:29,640 --> 00:49:31,449
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Who's ever standing,
we got to move!</i></b></font>

788
00:49:33,520 --> 00:49:34,567
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Guys?</i></b></font>

789
00:49:52,320 --> 00:49:53,606
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Again.</b></font>

790
00:49:53,920 --> 00:49:55,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You'll break them.</b></font>

791
00:49:55,600 --> 00:49:57,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Only the breakable ones.</b></font>

792
00:49:57,880 --> 00:49:59,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're made of marble.</b></font>

793
00:49:59,760 --> 00:50:01,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We'll celebrate
after the graduation ceremony.</b></font>

794
00:50:02,840 --> 00:50:03,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What if I fail?</b></font>

795
00:50:09,600 --> 00:50:10,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You never fail.</b></font>

796
00:50:33,680 --> 00:50:35,603
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you ready for our dance?</b></font>

797
00:50:44,800 --> 00:50:45,847
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is it him?</b></font>

798
00:50:46,200 --> 00:50:48,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is that the first son of Odin?</b></font>

799
00:50:48,640 --> 00:50:50,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Heimdall, your eyes.
- Oh.</b></font>

800
00:50:50,800 --> 00:50:52,689
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They see everything.</b></font>

801
00:50:53,040 --> 00:50:55,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They see you leading us to Hel.</b></font>

802
00:50:56,440 --> 00:50:57,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wake up!</b></font>

803
00:51:00,680 --> 00:51:02,648
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The war is over, Steve.</b></font>

804
00:51:03,000 --> 00:51:04,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We can go home.</b></font>

805
00:51:06,160 --> 00:51:07,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Imagine it.</b></font>

806
00:51:16,640 --> 00:51:18,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can still save you!</b></font>

807
00:51:18,560 --> 00:51:21,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're all dead! Can you not see?</b></font>

808
00:51:26,600 --> 00:51:28,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're a destroyer, Odinson.</b></font>

809
00:51:32,000 --> 00:51:34,002
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>See
where your power leads.</b></font>

810
00:51:45,000 --> 00:51:46,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sloppy.</b></font>

811
00:51:47,840 --> 00:51:48,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Pretending to fail.</b></font>

812
00:51:49,840 --> 00:51:51,205
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The ceremony is necessary</b></font>

813
00:51:52,520 --> 00:51:54,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>for you to take your place in the world.</b></font>

814
00:51:55,440 --> 00:51:56,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I have no place in the world.</b></font>

815
00:51:56,720 --> 00:51:57,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Exactly.</b></font>

816
00:52:02,640 --> 00:52:03,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What can I do?</b></font>

817
00:52:03,880 --> 00:52:04,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It hurts.</b></font>

818
00:52:06,200 --> 00:52:07,247
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm going to kill him.</b></font>

819
00:52:07,360 --> 00:52:08,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- I'll be right back.
- No.</b></font>

820
00:52:08,720 --> 00:52:10,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm all right.</b></font>

821
00:52:10,920 --> 00:52:12,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I want...</b></font>

822
00:52:15,000 --> 00:52:16,889
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I want to finish the plan.</b></font>

823
00:52:17,720 --> 00:52:19,404
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I want the big one.</b></font>

824
00:52:30,320 --> 00:52:32,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, the vibranium is getting away.</b></font>

825
00:52:33,000 --> 00:52:34,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And you're not going anywhere.</b></font>

826
00:52:34,440 --> 00:52:37,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Of course not. I'm already there.</b></font>

827
00:52:37,400 --> 00:52:38,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You'll catch on.</b></font>

828
00:52:38,520 --> 00:52:40,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But first, you might need
to catch Dr. Banner.</b></font>

829
00:52:55,720 --> 00:52:57,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>News or footage. Keyword, "Hulk."</b></font>

830
00:53:02,440 --> 00:53:04,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Natasha, I could really use a lullaby.</i></b></font>

831
00:53:04,360 --> 00:53:05,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's not gonna happen.</b></font>

832
00:53:05,920 --> 00:53:07,410
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not for a while.</b></font>

833
00:53:07,960 --> 00:53:09,689
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The whole team is down.</i></b></font>

834
00:53:10,160 --> 00:53:11,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You got no backup here.</i></b></font>

835
00:53:12,480 --> 00:53:13,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm calling in Veronica.</b></font>

836
00:53:25,320 --> 00:53:26,810
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We need backup!</b></font>

837
00:54:05,840 --> 00:54:07,205
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go! Keep moving!</b></font>

838
00:54:46,560 --> 00:54:48,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right, everybody, stand down!</b></font>

839
00:54:55,040 --> 00:54:56,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Will you listen to me?</i></b></font>

840
00:54:56,680 --> 00:54:59,081
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That little witch is
messing with your mind.</b></font>

841
00:54:59,200 --> 00:55:01,441
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're stronger than her.
You're smarter than her.</b></font>

842
00:55:01,560 --> 00:55:03,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're Bruce Banner.</b></font>

843
00:55:03,920 --> 00:55:05,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Right, right, right,
don't mention puny Banner.</b></font>

844
00:55:10,680 --> 00:55:11,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Okay!</i></b></font>

845
00:55:33,400 --> 00:55:34,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>In the back?</b></font>

846
00:55:34,840 --> 00:55:35,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Dick move, Banner.</b></font>

847
00:55:47,320 --> 00:55:48,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Veronica, give me a hand.</b></font>

848
00:56:16,760 --> 00:56:18,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go to sleep, go to sleep, go to sleep.</b></font>

849
00:56:27,600 --> 00:56:29,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay, pal, we're gonna
get you out of town.</b></font>

850
00:56:31,440 --> 00:56:32,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not that way, not that way.</b></font>

851
00:56:41,120 --> 00:56:43,009
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come on, Bruce!
You gotta work with me.</b></font>

852
00:56:56,480 --> 00:56:57,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Everybody, out!</i></b></font>

853
00:57:04,520 --> 00:57:05,806
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Going down?</i></b></font>

854
00:57:15,320 --> 00:57:16,560
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm sorry.</b></font>

855
00:57:30,640 --> 00:57:32,404
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Damage report?</b></font>

856
00:57:32,520 --> 00:57:34,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's comprehensive.
Show me something.</b></font>

857
00:57:46,560 --> 00:57:48,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How quickly can we buy this building?</b></font>

858
00:58:20,440 --> 00:58:22,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Move! Move! Move!
- Go, go, go!</b></font>

859
00:58:25,560 --> 00:58:26,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Flank him, flank him!</b></font>

860
00:59:16,320 --> 00:59:18,368
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The news
is loving you guys.</i></b></font>

861
00:59:19,480 --> 00:59:21,050
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Nobody else is.</i></b></font>

862
00:59:21,560 --> 00:59:23,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's been no official call
for Banner's arrest</b></font>

863
00:59:23,840 --> 00:59:25,968
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>but it's in the air.</i></b></font>

864
00:59:26,560 --> 00:59:27,607
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Stark Relief Foundation?</b></font>

865
00:59:27,720 --> 00:59:29,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Already on the scene.</i></b></font>

866
00:59:29,160 --> 00:59:32,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- How's the team?
- Everyone's...</b></font>

867
00:59:32,400 --> 00:59:34,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We took a hit. We'll shake it off.</b></font>

868
00:59:35,400 --> 00:59:37,607
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Well, for now,
I'd stay in stealth mode</i></b></font>

869
00:59:37,760 --> 00:59:38,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>and stay away from here.</i></b></font>

870
00:59:40,400 --> 00:59:41,925
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, run and hide?</b></font>

871
00:59:42,680 --> 00:59:44,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Until we can find Ultron,</i></b></font>

872
00:59:44,200 --> 00:59:47,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I don't have a lot else to offer.</i></b></font>

873
00:59:47,160 --> 00:59:49,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Neither do we.</b></font>

874
00:59:55,760 --> 00:59:57,364
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, you wanna switch out?</b></font>

875
00:59:57,560 --> 00:59:58,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, I'm good.</b></font>

876
00:59:59,320 --> 01:00:01,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If you wanna get some kip,
now's a good time</b></font>

877
01:00:01,360 --> 01:00:02,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>because we're still a few hours out.</b></font>

878
01:00:02,960 --> 01:00:04,530
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Few hours from where?</b></font>

879
01:00:05,440 --> 01:00:06,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A safe house.</b></font>

880
01:00:33,200 --> 01:00:34,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What is this place?</b></font>

881
01:00:34,800 --> 01:00:36,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Safe house.</b></font>

882
01:00:37,120 --> 01:00:38,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's hope.</b></font>

883
01:00:43,360 --> 01:00:44,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Honey?</b></font>

884
01:00:44,960 --> 01:00:46,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm home.</b></font>

885
01:00:48,720 --> 01:00:49,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hi.</b></font>

886
01:00:50,120 --> 01:00:52,168
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Company. Sorry, didn't call ahead.</b></font>

887
01:00:52,280 --> 01:00:53,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey.</b></font>

888
01:00:54,240 --> 01:00:55,736
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is an agent of some kind.</b></font>

889
01:00:55,760 --> 01:00:58,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Gentlemen, this is Laura.</b></font>

890
01:00:59,240 --> 01:01:01,083
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know all of your names.</b></font>

891
01:01:02,720 --> 01:01:04,768
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ooh. Incoming.</b></font>

892
01:01:05,680 --> 01:01:07,364
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Dad!
- Hi, sweetheart!</b></font>

893
01:01:07,480 --> 01:01:08,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, buddy.</b></font>

894
01:01:08,880 --> 01:01:10,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How are you guys doing?</b></font>

895
01:01:10,520 --> 01:01:12,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- These are smaller agents.
- Look at your face!</b></font>

896
01:01:12,600 --> 01:01:13,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, my goodness.</b></font>

897
01:01:14,080 --> 01:01:16,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Did you bring Auntie Nat?</b></font>

898
01:01:16,680 --> 01:01:19,763
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Why don't you hug her and find out?</b></font>

899
01:01:20,560 --> 01:01:22,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Sorry for barging in on you.
- Yeah, we would have called ahead,</b></font>

900
01:01:22,920 --> 01:01:24,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but we were busy having
no idea that you existed.</b></font>

901
01:01:25,280 --> 01:01:28,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, well, Fury helped me
set this up when I joined.</b></font>

902
01:01:29,080 --> 01:01:30,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He kept it off S.H.I.E.L.D.'s files.</b></font>

903
01:01:30,280 --> 01:01:31,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'd like to keep it that way.</b></font>

904
01:01:32,480 --> 01:01:34,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I figure it's a good place to lay low.</b></font>

905
01:01:34,320 --> 01:01:35,765
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Honey.</b></font>

906
01:01:36,800 --> 01:01:39,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I missed you. How's little Natasha, huh?</b></font>

907
01:01:39,440 --> 01:01:40,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>She's...</b></font>

908
01:01:43,040 --> 01:01:44,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nathaniel.</b></font>

909
01:01:46,800 --> 01:01:47,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Traitor.</b></font>

910
01:02:03,680 --> 01:02:04,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor?</b></font>

911
01:02:04,960 --> 01:02:06,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I saw something in that dream.</b></font>

912
01:02:06,920 --> 01:02:09,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I need answers. I won't find them here.</b></font>

913
01:02:20,080 --> 01:02:21,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We can go home.</i></b></font>

914
01:02:32,880 --> 01:02:34,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>See? You worried for nothing.</b></font>

915
01:02:34,840 --> 01:02:36,968
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Can't even feel the difference, can you?</b></font>

916
01:02:39,320 --> 01:02:40,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If they're sleeping here,</b></font>

917
01:02:40,680 --> 01:02:42,523
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>some of them
are gonna have to double up.</b></font>

918
01:02:44,600 --> 01:02:46,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, that's not gonna sell.</b></font>

919
01:02:49,560 --> 01:02:51,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What about Nat and Dr. Banner?</b></font>

920
01:02:52,320 --> 01:02:54,243
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How long has that been going on?</b></font>

921
01:02:54,760 --> 01:02:56,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Has what?</b></font>

922
01:02:56,960 --> 01:02:58,689
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You are so cute.</b></font>

923
01:02:58,920 --> 01:03:00,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nat and Banner?</b></font>

924
01:03:01,080 --> 01:03:02,491
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll explain when you're older,</b></font>

925
01:03:02,680 --> 01:03:05,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Hawkeye.
- Well, okay.</b></font>

926
01:03:07,320 --> 01:03:08,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's bad, right?</b></font>

927
01:03:09,080 --> 01:03:10,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nat seems really shaken.</b></font>

928
01:03:11,720 --> 01:03:13,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron has these allies.</b></font>

929
01:03:13,320 --> 01:03:15,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>These, uh, kids.</b></font>

930
01:03:15,680 --> 01:03:17,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They're punks, really.</b></font>

931
01:03:18,960 --> 01:03:21,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But they carry a big, damn stick.</b></font>

932
01:03:21,520 --> 01:03:22,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And Nat took a serious hit.</b></font>

933
01:03:23,920 --> 01:03:26,400
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Someone's gonna have to
teach them some manners.</b></font>

934
01:03:26,600 --> 01:03:28,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That someone being you.</b></font>

935
01:03:29,720 --> 01:03:32,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know
I totally support your avenging.</b></font>

936
01:03:32,680 --> 01:03:34,523
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I couldn't be prouder.</b></font>

937
01:03:36,080 --> 01:03:37,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But I see those guys...</b></font>

938
01:03:37,600 --> 01:03:39,568
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Those gods...</b></font>

939
01:03:41,560 --> 01:03:43,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You don't think they need me.</b></font>

940
01:03:43,960 --> 01:03:47,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think they do, which is a lot scarier.</b></font>

941
01:03:48,760 --> 01:03:50,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They're a mess.</b></font>

942
01:03:51,560 --> 01:03:52,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

943
01:03:53,320 --> 01:03:54,765
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I guess they're my mess.</b></font>

944
01:03:56,320 --> 01:03:57,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You need to be sure</b></font>

945
01:03:58,360 --> 01:04:01,045
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>that this team is really a team,</b></font>

946
01:04:01,160 --> 01:04:02,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and that they have your back.</b></font>

947
01:04:06,200 --> 01:04:08,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Things are changing for us.</b></font>

948
01:04:08,880 --> 01:04:11,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>In a few months' time,</b></font>

949
01:04:11,440 --> 01:04:14,205
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>you and me are gonna be outnumbered.</b></font>

950
01:04:14,320 --> 01:04:15,606
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I need...</b></font>

951
01:04:18,800 --> 01:04:20,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just be sure.</b></font>

952
01:04:21,440 --> 01:04:22,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, ma'am.</b></font>

953
01:04:32,160 --> 01:04:34,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can feel the difference.</b></font>

954
01:04:46,960 --> 01:04:49,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Scream, and your entire staff dies.</b></font>

955
01:04:51,560 --> 01:04:53,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I could've killed you, Helen,
the night we met.</b></font>

956
01:04:53,960 --> 01:04:55,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I didn't.</b></font>

957
01:04:55,160 --> 01:04:56,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do you expect a thank-you note?</b></font>

958
01:04:56,800 --> 01:04:58,484
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I expect you to know why.</b></font>

959
01:04:59,920 --> 01:05:01,256
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Cradle.</b></font>

960
01:05:01,280 --> 01:05:03,336
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>This is the next thing, Tony.</i></b></font>

961
01:05:03,360 --> 01:05:06,330
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is the next me.</b></font>

962
01:05:06,720 --> 01:05:09,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Regeneration Cradle prints tissue.</b></font>

963
01:05:09,400 --> 01:05:11,050
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It can't build a living body.</b></font>

964
01:05:11,160 --> 01:05:12,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It can. You can.</b></font>

965
01:05:12,720 --> 01:05:14,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You lack the materials.</b></font>

966
01:05:16,440 --> 01:05:17,805
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're a brilliant woman, Helen.</b></font>

967
01:05:21,080 --> 01:05:24,163
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But we all have room to improve.</b></font>

968
01:05:45,960 --> 01:05:48,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I didn't realise you were waiting.</b></font>

969
01:05:48,480 --> 01:05:52,883
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I would've joined you, but, uh, it
didn't seem like the right time.</b></font>

970
01:05:53,840 --> 01:05:55,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They used up all the hot water.</b></font>

971
01:05:56,760 --> 01:05:58,205
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I should've joined you.</b></font>

972
01:05:58,360 --> 01:06:00,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Missed our window.</b></font>

973
01:06:00,800 --> 01:06:02,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Did we?</b></font>

974
01:06:05,600 --> 01:06:06,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The world just saw the Hulk.</b></font>

975
01:06:09,400 --> 01:06:11,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The real Hulk, for the first time.</b></font>

976
01:06:14,560 --> 01:06:17,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- You know I have to leave.
- You assume that I have to stay?</b></font>

977
01:06:19,280 --> 01:06:21,931
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I had this, um, dream.</b></font>

978
01:06:22,280 --> 01:06:24,248
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The kind that seems normal at the time,</b></font>

979
01:06:25,480 --> 01:06:26,720
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but when you wake...</b></font>

980
01:06:26,920 --> 01:06:28,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What did you dream?</b></font>

981
01:06:29,280 --> 01:06:31,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That I was an Avenger.</b></font>

982
01:06:33,120 --> 01:06:34,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That I was anything more</b></font>

983
01:06:34,560 --> 01:06:36,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>than the assassin they made me.</b></font>

984
01:06:38,400 --> 01:06:40,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think you're being hard on yourself.</b></font>

985
01:06:42,600 --> 01:06:45,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Here I was hoping that was your job.</b></font>

986
01:06:48,040 --> 01:06:49,610
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What are you doing?</b></font>

987
01:06:51,240 --> 01:06:53,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm running with it.</b></font>

988
01:06:54,360 --> 01:06:55,964
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>With you.</b></font>

989
01:06:56,720 --> 01:06:59,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If running is the plan,</b></font>

990
01:07:00,160 --> 01:07:01,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>as far as you want.</b></font>

991
01:07:03,800 --> 01:07:05,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you out of your mind?</b></font>

992
01:07:10,920 --> 01:07:12,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I want you to understand that, um...</b></font>

993
01:07:12,440 --> 01:07:13,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Natasha,</b></font>

994
01:07:14,960 --> 01:07:16,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>where can I go?</b></font>

995
01:07:17,480 --> 01:07:19,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Where in the world am I not a threat?</b></font>

996
01:07:19,920 --> 01:07:22,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- You're not a threat to me.
- Are you sure?</b></font>

997
01:07:23,160 --> 01:07:24,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Even if I didn't just...</b></font>

998
01:07:26,600 --> 01:07:27,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's no future with me.</b></font>

999
01:07:29,640 --> 01:07:30,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can't ever...</b></font>

1000
01:07:30,880 --> 01:07:33,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can't have this.</b></font>

1001
01:07:33,840 --> 01:07:34,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Kids.</b></font>

1002
01:07:35,440 --> 01:07:38,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do the math. I physically can't.</b></font>

1003
01:07:39,760 --> 01:07:41,205
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Neither can I.</b></font>

1004
01:07:45,880 --> 01:07:49,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>In the Red Room where I was trained...</b></font>

1005
01:07:49,880 --> 01:07:52,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Where I was raised, um,</b></font>

1006
01:07:53,320 --> 01:07:55,971
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>they have a graduation ceremony.</b></font>

1007
01:07:57,600 --> 01:07:59,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They sterilise you.</b></font>

1008
01:08:02,640 --> 01:08:04,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's efficient.</b></font>

1009
01:08:06,960 --> 01:08:08,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>One less thing to worry about.</b></font>

1010
01:08:10,440 --> 01:08:13,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The one thing that might
matter more than a mission.</b></font>

1011
01:08:16,160 --> 01:08:18,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Makes everything easier.</b></font>

1012
01:08:19,440 --> 01:08:20,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Even killing.</b></font>

1013
01:08:25,760 --> 01:08:28,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You still think
you're the only monster on the team?</b></font>

1014
01:08:35,040 --> 01:08:37,122
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, we disappear?</b></font>

1015
01:08:43,800 --> 01:08:45,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor didn't say
where he was going for answers?</b></font>

1016
01:08:46,480 --> 01:08:49,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sometimes my teammates
don't tell me things.</b></font>

1017
01:08:50,120 --> 01:08:52,168
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I was kind of hoping
Thor would be the exception.</b></font>

1018
01:08:52,280 --> 01:08:54,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, give him time.</b></font>

1019
01:08:54,440 --> 01:08:56,363
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We don't know
what the Maximoff kid showed him.</b></font>

1020
01:08:58,560 --> 01:09:00,164
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Earth's mightiest heroes."</b></font>

1021
01:09:00,320 --> 01:09:01,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Pulled us apart like cotton candy.</b></font>

1022
01:09:02,280 --> 01:09:03,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Seems like you walked away all right.</b></font>

1023
01:09:06,200 --> 01:09:07,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is that a problem?</b></font>

1024
01:09:07,560 --> 01:09:09,483
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't trust a guy without a dark side.</b></font>

1025
01:09:10,680 --> 01:09:11,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Call me old-fashioned.</b></font>

1026
01:09:11,840 --> 01:09:14,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, let's just say
you haven't seen it yet.</b></font>

1027
01:09:14,720 --> 01:09:16,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know Ultron is trying
to tear us apart, right?</b></font>

1028
01:09:17,160 --> 01:09:19,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, I guess you'd know.</b></font>

1029
01:09:19,520 --> 01:09:20,806
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Whether you'd tell us
is a bit of a question.</b></font>

1030
01:09:20,960 --> 01:09:22,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Banner and I were doing research.</b></font>

1031
01:09:22,240 --> 01:09:24,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- That would affect the team.
- That would end the team!</b></font>

1032
01:09:24,680 --> 01:09:25,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Isn't that the mission?</b></font>

1033
01:09:25,960 --> 01:09:27,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Isn't that the "Why We Fight"?</b></font>

1034
01:09:27,320 --> 01:09:29,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So we can end the fight.
So we get to go home!</b></font>

1035
01:09:32,800 --> 01:09:35,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Every time someone tries
to win a war before it starts,</b></font>

1036
01:09:35,280 --> 01:09:36,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>innocent people die.</b></font>

1037
01:09:36,960 --> 01:09:37,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Every time.</b></font>

1038
01:09:40,440 --> 01:09:42,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm sorry. Mr. Stark...</b></font>

1039
01:09:43,720 --> 01:09:44,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Clint said you wouldn't mind,</b></font>

1040
01:09:44,920 --> 01:09:47,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but our tractor doesn't seem
to want to start at all.</b></font>

1041
01:09:47,760 --> 01:09:50,120
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- I thought maybe you might...
- Yeah, I'll give her a kick.</b></font>

1042
01:09:53,560 --> 01:09:55,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Don't take from my pile.</b></font>

1043
01:10:05,360 --> 01:10:06,521
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hello, Deere.</b></font>

1044
01:10:09,400 --> 01:10:10,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Tell me everything.</b></font>

1045
01:10:12,040 --> 01:10:13,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What ails you?</b></font>

1046
01:10:13,640 --> 01:10:14,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do me a favour.</b></font>

1047
01:10:16,920 --> 01:10:18,809
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Try not to bring it to life.</b></font>

1048
01:10:18,960 --> 01:10:20,485
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Why, Ms. Barton, you little minx.</b></font>

1049
01:10:20,840 --> 01:10:23,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I get it. Maria Hill called you, right?</b></font>

1050
01:10:23,480 --> 01:10:24,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Was she ever not working for you?</b></font>

1051
01:10:24,880 --> 01:10:26,370
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Artificial intelligence.</b></font>

1052
01:10:27,400 --> 01:10:29,050
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You never even hesitated.</b></font>

1053
01:10:29,360 --> 01:10:30,776
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Look, it's been a really long day,</b></font>

1054
01:10:30,800 --> 01:10:32,404
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>like Eugene O'Neill long,</b></font>

1055
01:10:32,520 --> 01:10:34,696
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>so how's about
we skip to the part where you're useful.</b></font>

1056
01:10:34,720 --> 01:10:35,960
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Look me in the eye and tell me</b></font>

1057
01:10:36,080 --> 01:10:37,320
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>you're going to shut him down.</b></font>

1058
01:10:37,640 --> 01:10:39,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're not the director of me.</b></font>

1059
01:10:39,160 --> 01:10:41,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm not the director of anybody.</b></font>

1060
01:10:41,320 --> 01:10:42,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm just an old man</b></font>

1061
01:10:43,600 --> 01:10:45,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>who cares very much about you.</b></font>

1062
01:10:48,040 --> 01:10:49,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And I'm the man
who killed the Avengers.</b></font>

1063
01:10:51,680 --> 01:10:52,806
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I saw it.</b></font>

1064
01:10:53,000 --> 01:10:54,570
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I didn't tell the team. How could I?</b></font>

1065
01:10:55,840 --> 01:10:57,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I saw them all dead, Nick. I felt it.</b></font>

1066
01:10:58,040 --> 01:10:59,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The whole world, too.</b></font>

1067
01:11:00,000 --> 01:11:01,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Because of me.</b></font>

1068
01:11:02,240 --> 01:11:03,685
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I wasn't ready.</b></font>

1069
01:11:05,160 --> 01:11:06,571
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I didn't do all I could.</b></font>

1070
01:11:07,600 --> 01:11:09,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Maximoff girl, she's working you, Stark.</b></font>

1071
01:11:10,320 --> 01:11:13,802
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Playing on your fear.
- I wasn't tricked, I was shown.</b></font>

1072
01:11:13,920 --> 01:11:16,207
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wasn't a nightmare, it was my legacy.</b></font>

1073
01:11:16,520 --> 01:11:18,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The end of the path I started us on.</b></font>

1074
01:11:19,560 --> 01:11:21,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You come up with some pretty
impressive inventions, Tony.</b></font>

1075
01:11:23,960 --> 01:11:25,371
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>War isn't one of them.</b></font>

1076
01:11:28,960 --> 01:11:30,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I watched my friends die.</b></font>

1077
01:11:30,680 --> 01:11:32,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You'd think that'd be
as bad as it gets, right?</b></font>

1078
01:11:34,120 --> 01:11:35,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nope.</b></font>

1079
01:11:36,560 --> 01:11:39,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- It wasn't the worst part.
- The worst part</b></font>

1080
01:11:40,120 --> 01:11:41,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>is that you didn't.</b></font>

1081
01:11:48,120 --> 01:11:49,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll see you tonight.</b></font>

1082
01:11:51,960 --> 01:11:53,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I like the look.</b></font>

1083
01:11:54,400 --> 01:11:56,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If you're going for
inconspicuous, though, near miss.</b></font>

1084
01:11:57,280 --> 01:11:58,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I need your help.</b></font>

1085
01:11:58,560 --> 01:11:59,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's nice to be needed.</b></font>

1086
01:11:59,960 --> 01:12:01,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's dangerous.</b></font>

1087
01:12:01,960 --> 01:12:03,689
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'd be disappointed if it wasn't.</b></font>

1088
01:12:06,600 --> 01:12:09,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron took you folks out
of play to buy himself time.</b></font>

1089
01:12:10,280 --> 01:12:13,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>My contacts all say
he's building something.</b></font>

1090
01:12:13,360 --> 01:12:15,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The amount of vibranium
he made off with,</b></font>

1091
01:12:16,080 --> 01:12:17,570
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't think it's just one thing.</b></font>

1092
01:12:17,680 --> 01:12:19,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What about Ultron himself?</b></font>

1093
01:12:19,120 --> 01:12:21,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, he's easy to track.
He's everywhere.</b></font>

1094
01:12:21,920 --> 01:12:24,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The guy is multiplying faster
than a Catholic rabbit.</b></font>

1095
01:12:24,960 --> 01:12:27,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It still doesn't help us get an angle
on any of his plans, though.</b></font>

1096
01:12:28,000 --> 01:12:29,081
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is he still going after launch codes?</b></font>

1097
01:12:29,360 --> 01:12:30,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, he is.</b></font>

1098
01:12:30,840 --> 01:12:32,330
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But he's not making any headway.</b></font>

1099
01:12:32,440 --> 01:12:34,522
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I cracked the Pentagon's firewall
in high school on a dare.</b></font>

1100
01:12:34,640 --> 01:12:37,296
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, I contacted our friends
at the Nexus about that.</b></font>

1101
01:12:37,320 --> 01:12:38,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nexus?</b></font>

1102
01:12:38,440 --> 01:12:40,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's the world
Internet hub in Oslo.</b></font>

1103
01:12:40,520 --> 01:12:42,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Every byte of data flows through there.</b></font>

1104
01:12:42,520 --> 01:12:43,567
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fastest access on Earth.</b></font>

1105
01:12:43,720 --> 01:12:44,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, what did they say?</b></font>

1106
01:12:45,000 --> 01:12:46,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's fixated on the missiles.</b></font>

1107
01:12:47,000 --> 01:12:48,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But the codes
are constantly being changed.</b></font>

1108
01:12:49,160 --> 01:12:50,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>By whom?</b></font>

1109
01:12:51,400 --> 01:12:52,606
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Parties unknown.</b></font>

1110
01:12:52,800 --> 01:12:53,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do we have an ally?</b></font>

1111
01:12:54,040 --> 01:12:56,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron's got an enemy.
That's not the same thing.</b></font>

1112
01:12:56,720 --> 01:12:58,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Still, I'd pay folding money
to know who it is.</b></font>

1113
01:12:58,680 --> 01:12:59,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I might need to visit Oslo.</b></font>

1114
01:13:00,320 --> 01:13:01,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Find our unknown.</b></font>

1115
01:13:01,640 --> 01:13:03,085
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, this is good times, boss,</b></font>

1116
01:13:03,200 --> 01:13:04,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but I was kind of hoping when I saw you,</b></font>

1117
01:13:04,600 --> 01:13:05,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>you'd have more than that.</b></font>

1118
01:13:05,880 --> 01:13:07,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I do. I have you.</b></font>

1119
01:13:08,760 --> 01:13:10,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Back in the day, I had eyes everywhere.</b></font>

1120
01:13:10,680 --> 01:13:11,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ears, everywhere else.</b></font>

1121
01:13:12,320 --> 01:13:15,324
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You kids had all the
tech you could dream up.</b></font>

1122
01:13:16,320 --> 01:13:18,322
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Here we all are, back on Earth,</b></font>

1123
01:13:18,560 --> 01:13:20,324
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>with nothing but our wit</b></font>

1124
01:13:20,480 --> 01:13:22,050
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and our will to save the world.</b></font>

1125
01:13:23,640 --> 01:13:25,802
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron says the Avengers
are the only thing</b></font>

1126
01:13:26,000 --> 01:13:27,445
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>between him and his mission.</b></font>

1127
01:13:27,560 --> 01:13:29,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And whether or not he admits it,</b></font>

1128
01:13:29,880 --> 01:13:32,611
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>his mission is global destruction.</b></font>

1129
01:13:33,840 --> 01:13:36,002
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All this, laid in a grave.</b></font>

1130
01:13:38,040 --> 01:13:39,724
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So stand.</b></font>

1131
01:13:40,520 --> 01:13:42,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Outwit the platinum bastard.</b></font>

1132
01:13:42,880 --> 01:13:44,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Steve doesn't like that kind of talk.</b></font>

1133
01:13:44,560 --> 01:13:45,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know what, Romanoff?</b></font>

1134
01:13:46,840 --> 01:13:48,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, what does he want?</b></font>

1135
01:13:49,880 --> 01:13:51,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>To become better.</b></font>

1136
01:13:51,720 --> 01:13:53,085
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Better than us.</b></font>

1137
01:13:53,440 --> 01:13:55,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- He keeps building bodies.
- Person bodies.</b></font>

1138
01:13:56,440 --> 01:13:58,044
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The human form is inefficient.</b></font>

1139
01:13:58,200 --> 01:14:00,362
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Biologically speaking, we're outmoded.</b></font>

1140
01:14:00,480 --> 01:14:02,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But he keeps coming back to it.</b></font>

1141
01:14:02,560 --> 01:14:04,696
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>When you two programmed him
to protect the human race,</b></font>

1142
01:14:04,720 --> 01:14:06,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>you amazingly failed.</b></font>

1143
01:14:06,360 --> 01:14:08,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They don't need to be protected.</b></font>

1144
01:14:08,920 --> 01:14:10,410
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They need to evolve.</b></font>

1145
01:14:12,560 --> 01:14:14,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron's going to evolve.</b></font>

1146
01:14:14,720 --> 01:14:15,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How?</b></font>

1147
01:14:17,080 --> 01:14:19,765
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Has anyone been in contact
with Helen Cho?</b></font>

1148
01:14:23,520 --> 01:14:25,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's beautiful.</b></font>

1149
01:14:25,600 --> 01:14:28,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The vibranium atoms aren't just
compatible with the tissue cells,</b></font>

1150
01:14:28,640 --> 01:14:29,880
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>they're binding them.</b></font>

1151
01:14:30,360 --> 01:14:31,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And S.H.I.E.L.D.
never even thought to...</b></font>

1152
01:14:31,880 --> 01:14:34,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The most versatile substance
on the planet,</b></font>

1153
01:14:34,560 --> 01:14:37,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and they used it to make a Frisbee.</b></font>

1154
01:14:37,240 --> 01:14:38,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Typical of humans.</b></font>

1155
01:14:38,560 --> 01:14:41,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They scratch the surface
and never think</b></font>

1156
01:14:43,040 --> 01:14:44,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to look within.</b></font>

1157
01:14:55,080 --> 01:14:56,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll take Natasha and Clint.</b></font>

1158
01:14:56,760 --> 01:14:58,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right. Strictly recon.
I'll hit the Nexus.</b></font>

1159
01:14:58,840 --> 01:14:59,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll join you as soon as I can.</b></font>

1160
01:15:00,080 --> 01:15:01,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If Ultron's really building a body...</b></font>

1161
01:15:01,840 --> 01:15:03,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He'll be more powerful than any of us.</b></font>

1162
01:15:03,560 --> 01:15:04,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Maybe all of us.</b></font>

1163
01:15:05,160 --> 01:15:06,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>An android designed by a robot.</b></font>

1164
01:15:07,200 --> 01:15:08,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know, I really miss the days</b></font>

1165
01:15:08,480 --> 01:15:10,608
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>when the weirdest thing
science ever created was me.</b></font>

1166
01:15:11,200 --> 01:15:12,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll drop Banner off at the tower.</b></font>

1167
01:15:13,000 --> 01:15:14,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You mind if I borrow Ms. Hill?</b></font>

1168
01:15:14,520 --> 01:15:16,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>She's all yours. Apparently.</b></font>

1169
01:15:16,440 --> 01:15:17,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What are you gonna do?</b></font>

1170
01:15:17,760 --> 01:15:20,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't know. Something
dramatic, I hope.</b></font>

1171
01:15:24,200 --> 01:15:25,929
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm gonna finish reflooring that sunroom</b></font>

1172
01:15:26,120 --> 01:15:27,884
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>as soon as I get back.</b></font>

1173
01:15:28,120 --> 01:15:30,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, then you'll find
another part of the house to tear apart.</b></font>

1174
01:15:30,960 --> 01:15:32,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No.</b></font>

1175
01:15:32,760 --> 01:15:34,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's the last project.</b></font>

1176
01:15:35,800 --> 01:15:36,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I promise.</b></font>

1177
01:15:55,080 --> 01:15:56,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, this is it.</b></font>

1178
01:15:58,240 --> 01:16:00,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Water of Sight.</b></font>

1179
01:16:02,800 --> 01:16:05,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>In every realm,
there's a reflection.</b></font>

1180
01:16:06,400 --> 01:16:07,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If the water's spirits accept me,</b></font>

1181
01:16:07,880 --> 01:16:09,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can return to my dream</b></font>

1182
01:16:10,640 --> 01:16:12,085
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and find what I missed.</b></font>

1183
01:16:12,320 --> 01:16:16,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Men who enter that water,
the legends don't end well.</b></font>

1184
01:16:17,840 --> 01:16:19,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A hacker
who's faster than Ultron?</b></font>

1185
01:16:19,760 --> 01:16:20,807
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He could be anywhere,</b></font>

1186
01:16:20,920 --> 01:16:23,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and as this is the centre of everything,</b></font>

1187
01:16:23,280 --> 01:16:24,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm just a guy looking for a needle</b></font>

1188
01:16:24,600 --> 01:16:26,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>in the world's biggest haystack.</b></font>

1189
01:16:27,680 --> 01:16:29,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How do you find it?</b></font>

1190
01:16:29,680 --> 01:16:32,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's pretty simple. You bring a magnet.</b></font>

1191
01:16:34,440 --> 01:16:35,521
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I'm decrypting nuclear codes.</i></b></font>

1192
01:16:35,680 --> 01:16:37,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And you don't want me to.</i></b></font>

1193
01:16:39,320 --> 01:16:40,810
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come and get me.</b></font>

1194
01:16:53,160 --> 01:16:54,207
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wake up!</b></font>

1195
01:17:01,040 --> 01:17:02,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor!</b></font>

1196
01:17:02,880 --> 01:17:03,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Extinction.</b></font>

1197
01:17:17,400 --> 01:17:19,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Cellular cohesion
will take a few hours,</b></font>

1198
01:17:19,720 --> 01:17:22,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but we can initiate
the consciousness stream.</b></font>

1199
01:17:22,720 --> 01:17:25,530
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're uploading your cerebral matrix</b></font>

1200
01:17:25,720 --> 01:17:26,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>now.</b></font>

1201
01:17:28,400 --> 01:17:29,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can read him.</b></font>

1202
01:17:30,720 --> 01:17:32,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's dreaming.</b></font>

1203
01:17:32,480 --> 01:17:34,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I wouldn't call it dreams.</b></font>

1204
01:17:34,520 --> 01:17:36,363
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's Ultron's base consciousness.</b></font>

1205
01:17:36,560 --> 01:17:38,085
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Informational noise. Soon...</b></font>

1206
01:17:38,320 --> 01:17:39,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How soon?</b></font>

1207
01:17:39,680 --> 01:17:41,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm not being pushy.</b></font>

1208
01:17:41,240 --> 01:17:42,920
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're imprinting
a physical brain.</b></font>

1209
01:17:43,040 --> 01:17:44,485
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There are no shortcuts.</b></font>

1210
01:17:44,760 --> 01:17:45,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Even if your magic gem...</b></font>

1211
01:17:56,680 --> 01:17:58,056
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How could you?</b></font>

1212
01:17:58,080 --> 01:17:59,127
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How could I what?</b></font>

1213
01:17:59,400 --> 01:18:02,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You said we would
destroy the Avengers,</b></font>

1214
01:18:02,720 --> 01:18:03,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>make a better world.</b></font>

1215
01:18:04,080 --> 01:18:05,127
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It will be better.</b></font>

1216
01:18:06,080 --> 01:18:08,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- When everyone is dead?
- That is not...</b></font>

1217
01:18:09,400 --> 01:18:13,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The human race will have
every opportunity to improve.</b></font>

1218
01:18:13,760 --> 01:18:15,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And if they don't?</b></font>

1219
01:18:15,280 --> 01:18:16,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ask Noah.</b></font>

1220
01:18:17,600 --> 01:18:18,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You are a madman.</b></font>

1221
01:18:18,760 --> 01:18:22,207
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There were more than a dozen
extinction-level events</b></font>

1222
01:18:22,360 --> 01:18:25,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>before even the dinosaurs got theirs.</b></font>

1223
01:18:25,560 --> 01:18:27,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>When the Earth starts to settle,</b></font>

1224
01:18:28,240 --> 01:18:30,129
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>God throws a stone at it.</b></font>

1225
01:18:30,280 --> 01:18:32,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And, believe me, he's winding up.</b></font>

1226
01:18:33,360 --> 01:18:34,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We have to evolve.</b></font>

1227
01:18:35,120 --> 01:18:36,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's no room</b></font>

1228
01:18:37,120 --> 01:18:38,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>for the weak.</b></font>

1229
01:18:38,480 --> 01:18:40,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And who decides who's weak?</b></font>

1230
01:18:41,320 --> 01:18:43,049
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Life.</b></font>

1231
01:18:43,680 --> 01:18:45,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Life always decides.</b></font>

1232
01:18:48,440 --> 01:18:49,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's incoming.</b></font>

1233
01:18:50,960 --> 01:18:54,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- The Quinjet. We have to move.
- That's not a problem.</b></font>

1234
01:19:01,280 --> 01:19:02,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wait, guys!</b></font>

1235
01:19:06,320 --> 01:19:07,606
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They'll understand.</b></font>

1236
01:19:07,920 --> 01:19:10,048
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>When they see, they'll understand.</b></font>

1237
01:19:10,440 --> 01:19:13,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I just need a little more time.</b></font>

1238
01:19:25,120 --> 01:19:27,248
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>2 minutes. Stay close.</b></font>

1239
01:19:34,440 --> 01:19:35,441
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Dr. Cho!</b></font>

1240
01:19:39,360 --> 01:19:40,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's uploading himself into the body.</b></font>

1241
01:19:41,000 --> 01:19:42,047
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Where?</b></font>

1242
01:19:43,840 --> 01:19:46,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The real power is inside the Cradle.</b></font>

1243
01:19:46,480 --> 01:19:47,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The gem,</b></font>

1244
01:19:48,280 --> 01:19:51,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>its power is uncontainable.</b></font>

1245
01:19:51,880 --> 01:19:53,530
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You can't just blow it up.</b></font>

1246
01:19:54,480 --> 01:19:56,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You have to get the Cradle to Stark.</b></font>

1247
01:19:56,840 --> 01:19:57,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>First, I have to find it.</b></font>

1248
01:19:58,200 --> 01:19:59,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go.</b></font>

1249
01:19:59,560 --> 01:20:00,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Did you guys copy that?</i></b></font>

1250
01:20:00,960 --> 01:20:02,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We did.</b></font>

1251
01:20:02,200 --> 01:20:04,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I got a private jet taking off across town.</b></font>

1252
01:20:05,000 --> 01:20:06,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No manifest.</b></font>

1253
01:20:06,400 --> 01:20:07,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That could be him.</b></font>

1254
01:20:08,400 --> 01:20:09,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There. It's a truck from the lab.</b></font>

1255
01:20:10,120 --> 01:20:11,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Right above you, Cap.</b></font>

1256
01:20:11,600 --> 01:20:13,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>On the loop by the bridge.</b></font>

1257
01:20:14,000 --> 01:20:15,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's them.</b></font>

1258
01:20:15,160 --> 01:20:16,960
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You got 3 with the
Cradle, one in the cab.</b></font>

1259
01:20:17,720 --> 01:20:18,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I could take out the driver.</b></font>

1260
01:20:18,880 --> 01:20:19,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Negative. That truck crashes,</i></b></font>

1261
01:20:20,080 --> 01:20:21,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>the gem could level the city.</b></font>

1262
01:20:22,080 --> 01:20:23,320
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We need to draw out Ultron.</i></b></font>

1263
01:20:33,040 --> 01:20:35,088
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, no, no, no.</b></font>

1264
01:20:36,920 --> 01:20:37,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Leave me alone!</b></font>

1265
01:20:46,600 --> 01:20:48,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, he's definitely unhappy.</b></font>

1266
01:20:48,440 --> 01:20:49,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm gonna try and keep him that way.</b></font>

1267
01:20:50,040 --> 01:20:51,087
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're not a match for him, Cap.</b></font>

1268
01:20:52,440 --> 01:20:53,521
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thanks, Barton.</b></font>

1269
01:21:16,240 --> 01:21:17,480
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know what's in that cradle?</b></font>

1270
01:21:18,800 --> 01:21:20,529
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The power to make real change.</b></font>

1271
01:21:20,640 --> 01:21:22,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And that terrifies you.</b></font>

1272
01:21:22,200 --> 01:21:23,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I wouldn't call it a comfort.</b></font>

1273
01:21:26,600 --> 01:21:27,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stop it.</b></font>

1274
01:21:38,480 --> 01:21:41,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We got a window. 4, 3...</b></font>

1275
01:21:41,800 --> 01:21:42,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Give him hell.</b></font>

1276
01:21:53,760 --> 01:21:55,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm always picking up after you boys.</b></font>

1277
01:21:56,840 --> 01:21:58,490
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They're heading under the overpass.
I've got no shot.</b></font>

1278
01:21:58,840 --> 01:21:59,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Which way?</i></b></font>

1279
01:22:00,080 --> 01:22:01,081
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hard right.</b></font>

1280
01:22:02,240 --> 01:22:03,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now.</b></font>

1281
01:22:34,200 --> 01:22:36,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Out of the way! Coming through!
Sorry, coming through!</b></font>

1282
01:22:52,240 --> 01:22:53,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come on!</b></font>

1283
01:22:53,880 --> 01:22:55,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Clint, can you
draw out the guards?</b></font>

1284
01:22:55,440 --> 01:22:56,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's find out.</b></font>

1285
01:22:57,520 --> 01:22:58,567
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Beep, beep!</b></font>

1286
01:23:36,040 --> 01:23:37,610
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They're heading back towards you.</b></font>

1287
01:23:37,760 --> 01:23:39,320
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So whatever you're gonna do, do it now.</b></font>

1288
01:23:44,800 --> 01:23:47,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I'm going in.
Cap, can you keep him occupied?</i></b></font>

1289
01:23:47,600 --> 01:23:49,489
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What do you think I've been doing?</b></font>

1290
01:24:33,080 --> 01:24:35,208
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Okay, package is airborne.</i></b></font>

1291
01:24:35,920 --> 01:24:37,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I have a clean shot.</b></font>

1292
01:24:37,440 --> 01:24:38,805
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Negative. I am still in the truck.</b></font>

1293
01:24:38,960 --> 01:24:39,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- What the hell are you...
- Just be ready.</b></font>

1294
01:24:40,120 --> 01:24:41,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm sending the package to you.</b></font>

1295
01:24:41,840 --> 01:24:43,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How do you want me to take it?</b></font>

1296
01:24:43,240 --> 01:24:45,322
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, you might wish
you hadn't asked that.</b></font>

1297
01:24:58,120 --> 01:24:59,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Please, don't do this.</b></font>

1298
01:25:00,360 --> 01:25:01,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What choice do we have?</b></font>

1299
01:25:10,200 --> 01:25:11,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I lost him!</b></font>

1300
01:25:11,360 --> 01:25:12,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's headed your way!</b></font>

1301
01:25:17,680 --> 01:25:18,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nat, we gotta go.</b></font>

1302
01:25:30,040 --> 01:25:31,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nat!</b></font>

1303
01:25:35,880 --> 01:25:36,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Cap, you see Nat?</b></font>

1304
01:25:37,840 --> 01:25:40,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If you have the package,
get it to Stark! Go!</b></font>

1305
01:25:40,720 --> 01:25:41,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do you have eyes on Nat?</b></font>

1306
01:25:42,040 --> 01:25:43,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Go!</i></b></font>

1307
01:25:45,040 --> 01:25:46,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Damn it.</b></font>

1308
01:25:46,560 --> 01:25:47,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Civilians in our path.</b></font>

1309
01:25:48,920 --> 01:25:50,445
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Can you stop this thing?</b></font>

1310
01:26:29,320 --> 01:26:30,651
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm fine.</b></font>

1311
01:26:30,760 --> 01:26:32,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I just need to take a minute.</b></font>

1312
01:26:32,920 --> 01:26:34,809
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm very tempted not to give you one.</b></font>

1313
01:26:34,960 --> 01:26:36,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Cradle. Did you get it?</b></font>

1314
01:26:37,040 --> 01:26:38,530
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark will take care of it.</b></font>

1315
01:26:39,920 --> 01:26:40,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, he won't.</b></font>

1316
01:26:44,440 --> 01:26:45,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You don't know
what you're talking about.</b></font>

1317
01:26:45,760 --> 01:26:46,776
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark's not crazy.</b></font>

1318
01:26:46,800 --> 01:26:48,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He will do anything to make things right.</b></font>

1319
01:26:53,800 --> 01:26:55,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark, come in.</b></font>

1320
01:26:55,600 --> 01:26:56,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark.</b></font>

1321
01:26:57,960 --> 01:26:59,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Anyone on comms.</b></font>

1322
01:26:59,200 --> 01:27:00,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron can't tell the difference</b></font>

1323
01:27:00,800 --> 01:27:03,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>between saving the world
and destroying it.</b></font>

1324
01:27:05,040 --> 01:27:07,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Where do you think he gets that?</b></font>

1325
01:27:09,680 --> 01:27:11,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Anything on Nat?
- I haven't heard.</b></font>

1326
01:27:11,360 --> 01:27:13,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But she's alive, or Ultron would
be rubbing our faces in it.</b></font>

1327
01:27:13,840 --> 01:27:15,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is sealed tight.</b></font>

1328
01:27:15,320 --> 01:27:16,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're gonna need
to access the program,</b></font>

1329
01:27:16,880 --> 01:27:18,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>break it down from within.</b></font>

1330
01:27:20,040 --> 01:27:21,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Any chance Natasha might leave you</b></font>

1331
01:27:21,480 --> 01:27:22,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>a message outside the Internet?</b></font>

1332
01:27:22,880 --> 01:27:23,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Old-school spy stuff?</b></font>

1333
01:27:24,400 --> 01:27:26,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There are
some nets I can cast.</b></font>

1334
01:27:26,320 --> 01:27:27,560
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, I'll find her.</b></font>

1335
01:27:30,160 --> 01:27:31,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can work on tissue degeneration</b></font>

1336
01:27:32,040 --> 01:27:35,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>if you could fry whatever
operational system Cho implanted.</b></font>

1337
01:27:35,400 --> 01:27:36,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, about that.</b></font>

1338
01:27:40,960 --> 01:27:41,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No.</b></font>

1339
01:27:42,160 --> 01:27:44,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- You have to trust me.
- Kind of don't.</b></font>

1340
01:27:44,160 --> 01:27:48,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Our ally, the guy protecting
the military's nuclear codes,</b></font>

1341
01:27:50,160 --> 01:27:51,216
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I found him.</b></font>

1342
01:27:51,240 --> 01:27:52,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Hello, Dr. Banner.</i></b></font>

1343
01:27:53,240 --> 01:27:55,521
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron didn't go after Jarvis
because he was angry.</b></font>

1344
01:27:56,080 --> 01:27:59,687
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He attacked him because he was
scared of what he can do.</b></font>

1345
01:28:00,840 --> 01:28:02,490
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So Jarvis went underground.</b></font>

1346
01:28:02,600 --> 01:28:04,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Scattered, dumped his memory.</b></font>

1347
01:28:04,680 --> 01:28:06,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But not his protocols.</b></font>

1348
01:28:06,600 --> 01:28:10,047
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He didn't even know he was in there
until I pieced him together.</b></font>

1349
01:28:12,880 --> 01:28:17,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, you want me to help you
put Jarvis into this thing?</b></font>

1350
01:28:17,800 --> 01:28:19,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No! Of course not.</b></font>

1351
01:28:19,720 --> 01:28:21,404
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I wanna help you put Jarvis in this thing.</b></font>

1352
01:28:23,800 --> 01:28:25,450
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're out of my field, here.</b></font>

1353
01:28:25,560 --> 01:28:27,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know bio-organics
better than anyone.</b></font>

1354
01:28:27,880 --> 01:28:30,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And you just assume
that Jarvis's operational matrix</b></font>

1355
01:28:30,880 --> 01:28:32,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>can beat Ultron's?</b></font>

1356
01:28:32,440 --> 01:28:35,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Jarvis has been beating him
from inside without knowing it.</b></font>

1357
01:28:35,880 --> 01:28:36,936
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is the opportunity.</b></font>

1358
01:28:36,960 --> 01:28:38,724
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We can create Ultron's perfect self</b></font>

1359
01:28:38,880 --> 01:28:42,362
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>without the homicidal glitches
he thinks are his winning personality.</b></font>

1360
01:28:42,480 --> 01:28:44,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- We have to.
<i>- I believe it's worth a go.</i></b></font>

1361
01:28:47,160 --> 01:28:48,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm in a loop!</b></font>

1362
01:28:48,400 --> 01:28:51,370
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm caught in a time loop.
This is exactly where it all went wrong.</b></font>

1363
01:28:51,480 --> 01:28:53,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know. I know. I know
what everyone's gonna say.</b></font>

1364
01:28:53,480 --> 01:28:55,448
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But they're already saying it.</b></font>

1365
01:28:56,000 --> 01:28:57,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're mad scientists.</b></font>

1366
01:28:57,920 --> 01:29:00,651
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're monsters, buddy.
We've gotta own it.</b></font>

1367
01:29:01,640 --> 01:29:02,880
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Make a stand.</b></font>

1368
01:29:08,280 --> 01:29:09,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's not a loop.</b></font>

1369
01:29:11,000 --> 01:29:12,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's the end of the line.</b></font>

1370
01:29:33,280 --> 01:29:35,408
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I wasn't sure you would wake up.</b></font>

1371
01:29:35,520 --> 01:29:38,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I hoped you would.
I wanted to show you.</b></font>

1372
01:29:39,120 --> 01:29:40,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't have anyone else.</b></font>

1373
01:29:43,640 --> 01:29:47,247
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think a lot about meteors.
The purity in them.</b></font>

1374
01:29:47,400 --> 01:29:48,925
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Boom! The end.</b></font>

1375
01:29:49,400 --> 01:29:50,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Start again.</b></font>

1376
01:29:50,960 --> 01:29:52,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The world made clean</b></font>

1377
01:29:53,040 --> 01:29:55,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>for the new man to rebuild.</b></font>

1378
01:29:55,680 --> 01:29:57,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I was meant to be new.</b></font>

1379
01:29:58,680 --> 01:30:01,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I was meant to be beautiful.</b></font>

1380
01:30:01,840 --> 01:30:03,968
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The world would have looked to the sky</b></font>

1381
01:30:04,080 --> 01:30:05,320
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and seen hope,</b></font>

1382
01:30:05,680 --> 01:30:07,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>seen mercy.</b></font>

1383
01:30:07,800 --> 01:30:09,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Instead, they'll look up in horror</b></font>

1384
01:30:10,000 --> 01:30:11,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>because of you.</b></font>

1385
01:30:11,520 --> 01:30:13,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You've wounded me.</b></font>

1386
01:30:14,000 --> 01:30:15,684
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I give you full marks for that.</b></font>

1387
01:30:16,320 --> 01:30:19,244
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But, like the man said,
what doesn't kill me...</b></font>

1388
01:30:24,480 --> 01:30:25,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>just makes me stronger.</b></font>

1389
01:31:05,880 --> 01:31:08,042
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This framework is not compatible.</b></font>

1390
01:31:08,200 --> 01:31:10,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The genetic coding tower is at 97%.</b></font>

1391
01:31:11,000 --> 01:31:14,846
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You have got to upload that schematic
in the next 3 minutes.</b></font>

1392
01:31:17,120 --> 01:31:19,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- I'm gonna say this once.
- How about "none-ce"?</b></font>

1393
01:31:19,240 --> 01:31:21,288
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Shut it down!
- Nope, not gonna happen.</b></font>

1394
01:31:21,400 --> 01:31:22,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You don't know what you're doing.</b></font>

1395
01:31:22,720 --> 01:31:24,051
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And you do?</b></font>

1396
01:31:24,400 --> 01:31:25,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>She's not in your head?</b></font>

1397
01:31:25,560 --> 01:31:27,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know you're angry.</b></font>

1398
01:31:27,320 --> 01:31:28,685
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, we're way past that.</b></font>

1399
01:31:28,800 --> 01:31:31,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I could choke the life out of you
and never change a shade.</b></font>

1400
01:31:31,480 --> 01:31:33,216
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Banner, after everything
that's happened...</b></font>

1401
01:31:33,240 --> 01:31:34,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's nothing compared to what's coming!</b></font>

1402
01:31:34,720 --> 01:31:37,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- You don't know what's in there.
- This isn't a game!</b></font>

1403
01:31:40,400 --> 01:31:41,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, no. Go on.</b></font>

1404
01:31:42,760 --> 01:31:44,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You were saying?</b></font>

1405
01:31:50,920 --> 01:31:51,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Pietro!</b></font>

1406
01:31:52,520 --> 01:31:53,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What?</b></font>

1407
01:31:54,000 --> 01:31:55,570
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You didn't see that coming?</b></font>

1408
01:31:57,760 --> 01:31:58,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm rerouting the upload.</b></font>

1409
01:32:05,240 --> 01:32:07,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go ahead, piss me off.</b></font>

1410
01:32:19,320 --> 01:32:20,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wait!</b></font>

1411
01:33:45,120 --> 01:33:47,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am sorry. That was</b></font>

1412
01:33:48,360 --> 01:33:49,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>odd.</b></font>

1413
01:33:50,000 --> 01:33:51,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

1414
01:33:56,160 --> 01:33:57,207
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor.</b></font>

1415
01:33:58,720 --> 01:34:01,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- You helped create this?
- I've had a vision.</b></font>

1416
01:34:01,560 --> 01:34:05,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A whirlpool that sucks in all hope of life,
and at its centre is that.</b></font>

1417
01:34:06,240 --> 01:34:07,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What? The gem?</b></font>

1418
01:34:07,400 --> 01:34:09,971
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's the Mind Stone.
It's one of the 6 Infinity Stones.</b></font>

1419
01:34:10,120 --> 01:34:11,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The greatest power in the universe,</b></font>

1420
01:34:11,480 --> 01:34:13,642
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>unparalleled in
its destructive capabilities.</b></font>

1421
01:34:13,760 --> 01:34:15,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Then why would you bring...
- Because Stark is right.</b></font>

1422
01:34:15,920 --> 01:34:18,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, it's definitely the end times.</b></font>

1423
01:34:18,560 --> 01:34:19,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Avengers cannot defeat Ultron.</b></font>

1424
01:34:19,880 --> 01:34:21,120
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not alone.</b></font>

1425
01:34:21,520 --> 01:34:23,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Why does your Vision sound like Jarvis?</b></font>

1426
01:34:23,560 --> 01:34:26,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We reconfigured Jarvis's matrix</b></font>

1427
01:34:26,760 --> 01:34:28,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to create something new.</b></font>

1428
01:34:28,760 --> 01:34:30,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think I've had my fill of new.</b></font>

1429
01:34:30,600 --> 01:34:32,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You think I'm a child of Ultron.</b></font>

1430
01:34:33,240 --> 01:34:34,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're not?</b></font>

1431
01:34:35,680 --> 01:34:37,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm not Ultron.</b></font>

1432
01:34:37,880 --> 01:34:40,087
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am not Jarvis. I am...</b></font>

1433
01:34:42,200 --> 01:34:43,611
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am.</b></font>

1434
01:34:45,520 --> 01:34:46,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I looked in your head</b></font>

1435
01:34:47,360 --> 01:34:49,124
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and saw annihilation.</b></font>

1436
01:34:49,280 --> 01:34:50,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Look again.</b></font>

1437
01:34:50,760 --> 01:34:52,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Her seal of approval means jack to me.</b></font>

1438
01:34:52,760 --> 01:34:54,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Their powers, the horrors in our heads,</b></font>

1439
01:34:54,920 --> 01:34:56,968
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron himself, they all
came from the Mind Stone.</b></font>

1440
01:34:57,120 --> 01:34:59,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And they're nothing
compared to what it can unleash.</b></font>

1441
01:34:59,440 --> 01:35:01,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- But with it on our side...
- Is it?</b></font>

1442
01:35:02,400 --> 01:35:03,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you?</b></font>

1443
01:35:04,440 --> 01:35:05,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>On our side?</b></font>

1444
01:35:07,760 --> 01:35:09,649
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't think it's that simple.</b></font>

1445
01:35:09,800 --> 01:35:12,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, it better
get real simple real soon.</b></font>

1446
01:35:13,400 --> 01:35:15,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am on the side of life.</b></font>

1447
01:35:15,760 --> 01:35:17,125
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron isn't.</b></font>

1448
01:35:17,720 --> 01:35:19,131
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He will end it all.</b></font>

1449
01:35:19,280 --> 01:35:21,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What's he waiting for?</b></font>

1450
01:35:21,360 --> 01:35:22,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- You.
- Where?</b></font>

1451
01:35:22,800 --> 01:35:23,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sokovia.</b></font>

1452
01:35:24,080 --> 01:35:25,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's got Nat there, too.</b></font>

1453
01:35:27,320 --> 01:35:28,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If we're wrong about you,</b></font>

1454
01:35:31,640 --> 01:35:33,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>if you're the monster
that Ultron made you to be...</b></font>

1455
01:35:34,160 --> 01:35:35,685
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What will you do?</b></font>

1456
01:35:42,320 --> 01:35:44,402
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't want to kill Ultron.</b></font>

1457
01:35:44,800 --> 01:35:48,122
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's unique and he's in pain.</b></font>

1458
01:35:49,680 --> 01:35:52,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But that pain will roll over the Earth.</b></font>

1459
01:35:52,800 --> 01:35:55,087
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, he must be destroyed.</b></font>

1460
01:35:55,320 --> 01:35:58,244
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Every form he's built,
every trace of his presence on the net.</b></font>

1461
01:35:58,520 --> 01:36:00,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We have to act now.</b></font>

1462
01:36:00,600 --> 01:36:04,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And not one of us
can do it without the others.</b></font>

1463
01:36:06,520 --> 01:36:08,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Maybe I am a monster.</b></font>

1464
01:36:08,600 --> 01:36:10,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't think I'd know if I were one.</b></font>

1465
01:36:12,000 --> 01:36:13,604
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm not what you are,</b></font>

1466
01:36:14,280 --> 01:36:16,442
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and not what you intended.</b></font>

1467
01:36:17,200 --> 01:36:19,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, there may be no way
to make you trust me.</b></font>

1468
01:36:19,960 --> 01:36:21,371
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But we need to go.</b></font>

1469
01:36:36,160 --> 01:36:37,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Right.</b></font>

1470
01:36:37,960 --> 01:36:39,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well done.</b></font>

1471
01:36:40,960 --> 01:36:42,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>3 minutes.</b></font>

1472
01:36:42,720 --> 01:36:44,370
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Get what you need.</b></font>

1473
01:37:00,200 --> 01:37:01,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Good evening, boss.</i></b></font>

1474
01:37:06,400 --> 01:37:08,084
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>No way we all get through this.</i></b></font>

1475
01:37:08,200 --> 01:37:10,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>If even one tin soldier
is left standing, we've lost.</i></b></font>

1476
01:37:11,000 --> 01:37:12,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's gonna be blood on the floor.</b></font>

1477
01:37:12,480 --> 01:37:13,891
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I got no plans tomorrow night.</b></font>

1478
01:37:14,000 --> 01:37:15,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I get first crack at the big guy.</b></font>

1479
01:37:15,760 --> 01:37:17,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Iron Man's the one he's waiting for.</b></font>

1480
01:37:17,360 --> 01:37:19,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's true. He hates you the most.</b></font>

1481
01:37:25,080 --> 01:37:27,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron knows we're coming.</b></font>

1482
01:37:27,520 --> 01:37:29,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Odds are we'll be riding into heavy fire.</b></font>

1483
01:37:30,240 --> 01:37:31,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And that's what we signed up for.</b></font>

1484
01:37:32,240 --> 01:37:34,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But the people of Sokovia, they didn't.</b></font>

1485
01:37:35,880 --> 01:37:37,370
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So our priority</i></b></font>

1486
01:37:38,080 --> 01:37:39,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>is getting them out.</i></b></font>

1487
01:37:39,400 --> 01:37:42,324
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're under attack! Clear the city! Now!</b></font>

1488
01:37:50,120 --> 01:37:51,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Get off your asses.</b></font>

1489
01:37:52,800 --> 01:37:54,920
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>All they want
is to live their lives in peace.</i></b></font>

1490
01:37:55,280 --> 01:37:56,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And that's not gonna happen today.</i></b></font>

1491
01:37:58,280 --> 01:38:00,009
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But we can do our best to protect them.</i></b></font>

1492
01:38:00,720 --> 01:38:02,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And we can get the job done.</i></b></font>

1493
01:38:05,640 --> 01:38:07,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We find out what Ultron's been building,</i></b></font>

1494
01:38:08,880 --> 01:38:10,484
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>we find Romanoff,</i></b></font>

1495
01:38:10,960 --> 01:38:12,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>and we clear the field.</i></b></font>

1496
01:38:14,240 --> 01:38:16,163
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Keep the fight between us.</i></b></font>

1497
01:38:22,880 --> 01:38:25,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron thinks we're monsters.</b></font>

1498
01:38:25,800 --> 01:38:28,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That we're what's wrong with the world.</b></font>

1499
01:38:28,320 --> 01:38:30,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This isn't just about beating him.</b></font>

1500
01:38:31,160 --> 01:38:33,208
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's about whether he's right.</b></font>

1501
01:38:39,680 --> 01:38:40,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Natasha!</b></font>

1502
01:38:41,840 --> 01:38:42,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Natasha!</b></font>

1503
01:38:43,000 --> 01:38:44,081
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Bruce?</b></font>

1504
01:38:45,520 --> 01:38:46,521
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You all right?</b></font>

1505
01:38:46,680 --> 01:38:47,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

1506
01:38:47,840 --> 01:38:49,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The team is in the city.
It's about to light up.</b></font>

1507
01:38:49,680 --> 01:38:51,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't suppose you found
a key lying around somewhere.</b></font>

1508
01:38:52,160 --> 01:38:54,288
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah. I did.</b></font>

1509
01:39:00,680 --> 01:39:01,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So what's our play?</b></font>

1510
01:39:02,040 --> 01:39:03,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm here to get you to safety.</b></font>

1511
01:39:04,160 --> 01:39:06,686
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Job's not finished.
- We could help with the evacuation,</b></font>

1512
01:39:06,840 --> 01:39:08,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but I can't be in a fight near civilians.</b></font>

1513
01:39:10,040 --> 01:39:11,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And you've done plenty.</b></font>

1514
01:39:13,600 --> 01:39:15,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Our fight is over.</b></font>

1515
01:39:16,480 --> 01:39:18,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, we just disappear?</b></font>

1516
01:39:22,880 --> 01:39:24,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come on.</b></font>

1517
01:39:29,520 --> 01:39:31,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Your man's
in the church, boss.</i></b></font>

1518
01:39:31,880 --> 01:39:33,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I think he's waiting for you.</i></b></font>

1519
01:39:37,800 --> 01:39:39,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come to confess your sins?</b></font>

1520
01:39:39,960 --> 01:39:41,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I don't know. How much time you got?</b></font>

1521
01:39:41,360 --> 01:39:42,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>More than you.</b></font>

1522
01:39:44,080 --> 01:39:45,127
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh...</b></font>

1523
01:39:45,240 --> 01:39:48,050
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Have you been juicing?
Little vibranium cocktail?</b></font>

1524
01:39:48,160 --> 01:39:50,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're looking...
I don't wanna say "puffy."</b></font>

1525
01:39:50,560 --> 01:39:52,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're stalling to protect the people.</b></font>

1526
01:39:52,680 --> 01:39:55,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, that is the mission. Did you forget?</b></font>

1527
01:39:55,840 --> 01:39:58,320
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I've moved beyond your mission.
I'm free.</b></font>

1528
01:40:03,080 --> 01:40:04,127
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What?</b></font>

1529
01:40:05,040 --> 01:40:07,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You think you were
the only one stalling?</b></font>

1530
01:40:08,080 --> 01:40:09,730
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>There's the rest
of the vibranium.</i></b></font>

1531
01:40:09,840 --> 01:40:11,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Function, still unclear.</i></b></font>

1532
01:40:11,440 --> 01:40:12,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is how you end, Tony.</b></font>

1533
01:40:13,880 --> 01:40:15,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is peace in my time.</b></font>

1534
01:40:32,360 --> 01:40:33,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go!</b></font>

1535
01:40:38,960 --> 01:40:40,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Get off the bridge!</b></font>

1536
01:40:44,440 --> 01:40:45,441
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Run!</b></font>

1537
01:40:47,440 --> 01:40:49,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ultron.</b></font>

1538
01:40:54,760 --> 01:40:55,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>My Vision.</b></font>

1539
01:40:56,200 --> 01:40:58,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They really did take everything from me.</b></font>

1540
01:40:58,640 --> 01:41:00,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You set the terms.
You can change them.</b></font>

1541
01:41:00,800 --> 01:41:02,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right.</b></font>

1542
01:41:26,240 --> 01:41:27,480
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Friday, the Vision?</b></font>

1543
01:41:27,640 --> 01:41:29,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Boss, it's working.
He's burning Ultron out of the net.</i></b></font>

1544
01:41:29,840 --> 01:41:31,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>He won't escape through there.</i></b></font>

1545
01:41:36,120 --> 01:41:37,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You shut me out.</b></font>

1546
01:41:37,920 --> 01:41:39,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You think I care?</b></font>

1547
01:41:41,120 --> 01:41:42,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You take away my world,</b></font>

1548
01:41:43,200 --> 01:41:44,929
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I take away yours.</b></font>

1549
01:42:29,480 --> 01:42:30,686
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Friday.</b></font>

1550
01:42:30,800 --> 01:42:33,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Sokovia is going for a ride.</i></b></font>

1551
01:42:45,760 --> 01:42:47,250
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do you see</b></font>

1552
01:42:47,720 --> 01:42:49,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>the beauty of it?</b></font>

1553
01:42:49,840 --> 01:42:51,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The inevitability.</b></font>

1554
01:42:51,920 --> 01:42:55,163
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You rise, only to fall.</b></font>

1555
01:42:57,920 --> 01:43:00,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You, Avengers, you are my meteor.</i></b></font>

1556
01:43:01,680 --> 01:43:03,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>My swift and terrible sword.</i></b></font>

1557
01:43:03,600 --> 01:43:05,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And the earth will crack</i></b></font>

1558
01:43:05,280 --> 01:43:07,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>with the weight of your failure.</i></b></font>

1559
01:43:08,880 --> 01:43:12,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Purge me from your computers,
turn my own flesh against me.</i></b></font>

1560
01:43:13,120 --> 01:43:14,531
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It means nothing.</i></b></font>

1561
01:43:15,600 --> 01:43:16,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>When the dust settles,</i></b></font>

1562
01:43:17,120 --> 01:43:19,009
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>the only thing living in this world</i></b></font>

1563
01:43:19,520 --> 01:43:20,521
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>will be metal.</i></b></font>

1564
01:43:25,080 --> 01:43:26,650
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We gotta move.</b></font>

1565
01:43:26,960 --> 01:43:28,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're not gonna turn green?</b></font>

1566
01:43:28,280 --> 01:43:30,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I've got a compelling reason
not to lose my cool.</b></font>

1567
01:43:31,360 --> 01:43:32,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I adore you.</b></font>

1568
01:43:41,280 --> 01:43:43,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But I need the other guy.</b></font>

1569
01:43:48,040 --> 01:43:49,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's finish the job.</b></font>

1570
01:44:06,600 --> 01:44:08,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I really hope this makes us even.</b></font>

1571
01:44:10,320 --> 01:44:12,368
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now go be a hero.</b></font>

1572
01:44:20,840 --> 01:44:22,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The vibranium core's
got a magnetic field.</i></b></font>

1573
01:44:22,920 --> 01:44:24,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>That's what's keeping the rock together.</i></b></font>

1574
01:44:25,040 --> 01:44:26,136
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If it drops?</b></font>

1575
01:44:26,160 --> 01:44:27,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Right now, the impact
will kill thousands.</i></b></font>

1576
01:44:27,560 --> 01:44:30,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Once it gets high enough?
Global extinction.</i></b></font>

1577
01:44:34,600 --> 01:44:36,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>That building's not clear. The 10th floor.</i></b></font>

1578
01:44:41,560 --> 01:44:42,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hi.</b></font>

1579
01:44:43,680 --> 01:44:46,047
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay. Get in the tub!</b></font>

1580
01:44:52,880 --> 01:44:54,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I got airborne,
heading up to the bridge.</i></b></font>

1581
01:44:57,520 --> 01:44:58,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Cap, you got incoming.</b></font>

1582
01:44:58,880 --> 01:45:00,530
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Incoming already came in.</b></font>

1583
01:45:03,200 --> 01:45:05,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark, you worry about
bringing the city back down safely.</b></font>

1584
01:45:06,400 --> 01:45:08,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The rest of us have one job,</i></b></font>

1585
01:45:08,360 --> 01:45:09,521
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>tear these things apart.</i></b></font>

1586
01:45:09,840 --> 01:45:11,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You get hurt, hurt them back.</i></b></font>

1587
01:45:12,120 --> 01:45:13,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You get killed,</i></b></font>

1588
01:45:14,320 --> 01:45:15,606
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>walk it off.</b></font>

1589
01:45:50,040 --> 01:45:51,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go, go, go!</b></font>

1590
01:45:56,920 --> 01:45:58,684
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How could I let this happen?</b></font>

1591
01:45:58,800 --> 01:46:00,848
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Hey, hey, you okay?
- This is all our fault.</b></font>

1592
01:46:01,040 --> 01:46:03,256
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, look at me.
It's your fault, it's everyone's fault.</b></font>

1593
01:46:03,280 --> 01:46:04,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Who cares?</b></font>

1594
01:46:04,440 --> 01:46:05,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you up for this?</b></font>

1595
01:46:06,080 --> 01:46:07,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you?</b></font>

1596
01:46:07,400 --> 01:46:08,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Look, I just need to know.</b></font>

1597
01:46:08,600 --> 01:46:10,807
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Because the city is flying.</b></font>

1598
01:46:11,120 --> 01:46:12,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay. Look, the city is flying,</b></font>

1599
01:46:13,080 --> 01:46:15,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>we're fighting an army of robots,</b></font>

1600
01:46:15,920 --> 01:46:17,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and I have a bow and arrow.</b></font>

1601
01:46:17,280 --> 01:46:18,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>None of this makes sense.</b></font>

1602
01:46:21,640 --> 01:46:23,768
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But I'm going back out there
because it's my job.</b></font>

1603
01:46:24,640 --> 01:46:27,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay? And I can't do my job and babysit.</b></font>

1604
01:46:27,440 --> 01:46:30,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It doesn't matter
what you did or what you were.</b></font>

1605
01:46:30,640 --> 01:46:33,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If you go out there, you fight,
and you fight to kill.</b></font>

1606
01:46:34,280 --> 01:46:36,936
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stay in here, you're good.
I'll send your brother to come find you.</b></font>

1607
01:46:36,960 --> 01:46:38,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But if you step out that door,</b></font>

1608
01:46:39,720 --> 01:46:40,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>you are an Avenger.</b></font>

1609
01:46:45,600 --> 01:46:47,409
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right. Good chat.</b></font>

1610
01:46:51,160 --> 01:46:52,207
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, the city is flying.</b></font>

1611
01:47:26,200 --> 01:47:27,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I got you!</b></font>

1612
01:47:27,680 --> 01:47:28,920
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just look at me!</b></font>

1613
01:47:35,680 --> 01:47:37,011
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You can't save them all.</i></b></font>

1614
01:47:38,360 --> 01:47:39,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You'll never...</b></font>

1615
01:47:40,680 --> 01:47:43,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Never" what? You didn't finish!</b></font>

1616
01:47:46,880 --> 01:47:48,450
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What, were you napping?</b></font>

1617
01:48:09,920 --> 01:48:11,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor.</b></font>

1618
01:48:13,600 --> 01:48:15,204
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're bothering me.</b></font>

1619
01:48:23,240 --> 01:48:24,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ow!</b></font>

1620
01:48:50,600 --> 01:48:51,936
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right, we're all clear here.</b></font>

1621
01:48:51,960 --> 01:48:53,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We are not clear!</b></font>

1622
01:48:53,120 --> 01:48:54,531
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We are very not clear!</b></font>

1623
01:48:57,600 --> 01:48:58,931
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right, coming to you.</b></font>

1624
01:48:59,400 --> 01:49:01,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Keep up, old man!</b></font>

1625
01:49:03,240 --> 01:49:04,765
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nobody would know.</b></font>

1626
01:49:05,600 --> 01:49:06,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nobody.</b></font>

1627
01:49:08,600 --> 01:49:11,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"The last I saw him,
an Ultron was sitting on him."</b></font>

1628
01:49:11,640 --> 01:49:13,576
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Yeah, he'll be missed,
that quick little bastard."</b></font>

1629
01:49:13,600 --> 01:49:14,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"I miss him already."</b></font>

1630
01:49:30,160 --> 01:49:31,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hold your fire!</b></font>

1631
01:49:41,200 --> 01:49:42,247
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Romanoff!</b></font>

1632
01:49:42,760 --> 01:49:43,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thanks!</b></font>

1633
01:49:53,160 --> 01:49:54,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The anti-gravs
are rigged to flip.</i></b></font>

1634
01:49:54,880 --> 01:49:57,042
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Touch them, they'll go
full reverse thrust.</i></b></font>

1635
01:49:57,160 --> 01:49:58,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The city's not coming down slow.</i></b></font>

1636
01:49:58,720 --> 01:49:59,846
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Spire is vibranium.</b></font>

1637
01:49:59,960 --> 01:50:01,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If I get Thor to hit it...</b></font>

1638
01:50:01,360 --> 01:50:02,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It will crack. That's not enough.</i></b></font>

1639
01:50:02,840 --> 01:50:04,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The impact would still be devastating.</i></b></font>

1640
01:50:04,520 --> 01:50:05,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Maybe if we can
cap the other end.</b></font>

1641
01:50:06,040 --> 01:50:07,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Keep the atomic action doubling back.</b></font>

1642
01:50:07,840 --> 01:50:09,320
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>That could vaporise the city.</i></b></font>

1643
01:50:10,200 --> 01:50:12,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And everyone on it.</i></b></font>

1644
01:50:17,880 --> 01:50:19,723
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The next wave
is gonna hit any minute.</b></font>

1645
01:50:19,880 --> 01:50:22,000
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- What do you got, Stark?
- <i>Huh? Nothing great.</i></b></font>

1646
01:50:22,640 --> 01:50:24,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Maybe a way to blow up the city.</b></font>

1647
01:50:25,000 --> 01:50:26,286
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That'll keep it
from impacting the surface,</b></font>

1648
01:50:26,400 --> 01:50:27,447
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>if you guys can get clear.</b></font>

1649
01:50:27,720 --> 01:50:29,609
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I asked for a solution,
not an escape plan.</b></font>

1650
01:50:29,840 --> 01:50:32,730
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Impact radius
is getting bigger every second.</i></b></font>

1651
01:50:32,920 --> 01:50:34,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We're gonna have to make a choice.</i></b></font>

1652
01:50:35,040 --> 01:50:36,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Cap,
these people are going nowhere.</b></font>

1653
01:50:37,400 --> 01:50:40,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- If Stark finds a way to blow this rock...
- Not till everyone's safe.</b></font>

1654
01:50:40,600 --> 01:50:43,604
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Everyone up here versus everyone
down there? There's no math there.</b></font>

1655
01:50:43,840 --> 01:50:45,816
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm not leaving this rock
with one civilian on it.</b></font>

1656
01:50:45,840 --> 01:50:47,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I didn't say we should leave.</b></font>

1657
01:50:50,120 --> 01:50:51,929
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's worse ways to go.</b></font>

1658
01:50:57,400 --> 01:50:59,846
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Where else am I gonna get
a view like this?</b></font>

1659
01:51:00,720 --> 01:51:03,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Glad
you like the view, Romanoff.</i></b></font>

1660
01:51:03,440 --> 01:51:05,044
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It's about to get better.</i></b></font>

1661
01:51:29,160 --> 01:51:30,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Nice, right?</i></b></font>

1662
01:51:30,480 --> 01:51:32,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Pulled her out of mothballs
with a couple of old friends.</b></font>

1663
01:51:33,080 --> 01:51:34,730
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>She's dusty, but she'll do.</b></font>

1664
01:51:35,080 --> 01:51:36,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fury, you son of a bitch.</b></font>

1665
01:51:36,680 --> 01:51:38,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ooh! You kiss your mother
with that mouth?</b></font>

1666
01:51:39,080 --> 01:51:41,287
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Altitude is 18,000 and climbing.</b></font>

1667
01:51:41,440 --> 01:51:42,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Lifeboats secure to deploy.</b></font>

1668
01:51:43,080 --> 01:51:45,765
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Disengage in 3, 2...</b></font>

1669
01:51:46,960 --> 01:51:47,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Take them out.</b></font>

1670
01:51:57,640 --> 01:51:59,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is S.H.I.E.L.D.?</b></font>

1671
01:51:59,280 --> 01:52:01,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is what S.H.I.E.L.D.
is supposed to be.</b></font>

1672
01:52:03,400 --> 01:52:04,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is not so bad.</b></font>

1673
01:52:08,080 --> 01:52:09,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's load them up.</b></font>

1674
01:52:14,800 --> 01:52:16,165
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sir, we have multiple bogies</b></font>

1675
01:52:16,320 --> 01:52:18,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>converging on our starboard flank.</b></font>

1676
01:52:19,000 --> 01:52:20,206
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Show 'em what we got.</b></font>

1677
01:52:20,560 --> 01:52:21,561
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're up.</b></font>

1678
01:52:26,840 --> 01:52:27,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes!</b></font>

1679
01:52:28,080 --> 01:52:29,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now this is gonna be a good story.</b></font>

1680
01:52:32,480 --> 01:52:34,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yup. If you live to tell it.</b></font>

1681
01:52:34,720 --> 01:52:36,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You think
I can't hold my own?</b></font>

1682
01:52:36,840 --> 01:52:38,496
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We get through this, I'll hold your own.</b></font>

1683
01:52:38,520 --> 01:52:40,363
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You had to make it weird.</b></font>

1684
01:52:45,200 --> 01:52:48,170
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I got about 50 to 100 more
coming in after this group.</b></font>

1685
01:53:05,120 --> 01:53:06,531
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Here we go. Here we go. Let's move.</b></font>

1686
01:53:06,880 --> 01:53:08,200
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's go, everyone!</b></font>

1687
01:53:10,480 --> 01:53:12,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Number 6 boat is topped and locked...</b></font>

1688
01:53:12,600 --> 01:53:15,001
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Or stocked... Topped...</b></font>

1689
01:53:15,520 --> 01:53:16,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's full of people.</b></font>

1690
01:53:18,720 --> 01:53:19,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Incoming!</b></font>

1691
01:53:22,840 --> 01:53:23,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, God!</b></font>

1692
01:53:34,400 --> 01:53:35,920
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You think
you're saving anyone?</i></b></font>

1693
01:53:37,520 --> 01:53:39,522
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I turn that key and drop
this rock a little early</b></font>

1694
01:53:39,680 --> 01:53:41,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and it's still billions dead.</b></font>

1695
01:53:42,240 --> 01:53:43,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Even you can't stop that.</b></font>

1696
01:53:43,560 --> 01:53:45,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am Thor, son of Odin,</b></font>

1697
01:53:46,080 --> 01:53:48,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and as long as
there is life in my breast...</b></font>

1698
01:53:48,520 --> 01:53:52,081
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am running out of things to say!
Are you ready?</b></font>

1699
01:53:59,760 --> 01:54:01,216
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's terribly well-balanced.</b></font>

1700
01:54:01,240 --> 01:54:04,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, if there's too much weight,
you lose power on the swing, so...</b></font>

1701
01:54:05,680 --> 01:54:08,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I got it. Create a heat seal.</b></font>

1702
01:54:08,760 --> 01:54:09,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I could...</b></font>

1703
01:54:09,880 --> 01:54:12,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I could supercharge
the spire from below.</b></font>

1704
01:54:12,440 --> 01:54:13,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Running numbers.</i></b></font>

1705
01:54:23,600 --> 01:54:25,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>A heat seal could work
with enough power.</i></b></font>

1706
01:54:25,760 --> 01:54:27,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Thor, I got a plan.
- <i>We're out of time.</i></b></font>

1707
01:54:27,960 --> 01:54:29,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>They're coming for the core.</i></b></font>

1708
01:54:29,280 --> 01:54:31,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Rhodey, get the rest of the people
on board that carrier.</b></font>

1709
01:54:31,240 --> 01:54:34,449
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- On it.
- Avengers, time to work for a living.</b></font>

1710
01:54:43,560 --> 01:54:44,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Are you good?
- Yeah.</b></font>

1711
01:54:46,280 --> 01:54:47,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Romanoff.</b></font>

1712
01:54:47,480 --> 01:54:49,936
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You and Banner better not be
playing "hide the zucchini."</b></font>

1713
01:54:49,960 --> 01:54:51,041
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Relax, shellhead.</i></b></font>

1714
01:54:51,440 --> 01:54:52,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not all of us can fly.</b></font>

1715
01:54:58,640 --> 01:55:00,324
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- What's the drill?
- This is the drill.</b></font>

1716
01:55:00,480 --> 01:55:02,642
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If Ultron gets a hand
on the core, we lose.</b></font>

1717
01:55:07,240 --> 01:55:09,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is that the best you can do?</b></font>

1718
01:55:19,120 --> 01:55:20,690
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You had to ask.</b></font>

1719
01:55:20,800 --> 01:55:23,121
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is the best I can do.</b></font>

1720
01:55:23,240 --> 01:55:24,890
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is exactly what I wanted.</b></font>

1721
01:55:25,240 --> 01:55:26,571
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All of you</b></font>

1722
01:55:26,680 --> 01:55:28,330
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>against all of me.</b></font>

1723
01:55:28,600 --> 01:55:30,807
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How can you possibly hope to stop me?</b></font>

1724
01:55:31,680 --> 01:55:33,523
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, like the old man said...</b></font>

1725
01:55:34,840 --> 01:55:35,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Together.</b></font>

1726
01:57:04,760 --> 01:57:07,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know, with the benefit of hindsight...</b></font>

1727
01:57:16,440 --> 01:57:17,441
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They'll try to leave the city.</b></font>

1728
01:57:17,600 --> 01:57:19,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We can't let them,
not even one. Rhodey.</b></font>

1729
01:57:19,640 --> 01:57:20,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm on it.</b></font>

1730
01:57:21,120 --> 01:57:22,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, no. I didn't say you could leave.</b></font>

1731
01:57:23,120 --> 01:57:25,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>War Machine coming at you! Right...</b></font>

1732
01:57:31,600 --> 01:57:32,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay, what?</b></font>

1733
01:57:33,200 --> 01:57:35,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We gotta move out.
Even I can tell the air is getting thin.</b></font>

1734
01:57:35,360 --> 01:57:36,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You guys get to the boats.</b></font>

1735
01:57:36,800 --> 01:57:38,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll sweep for stragglers.
Be right behind you.</b></font>

1736
01:57:38,800 --> 01:57:41,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- What about the core?
- I'll protect it.</b></font>

1737
01:57:43,040 --> 01:57:44,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's my job.</b></font>

1738
01:57:45,320 --> 01:57:46,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nat.</b></font>

1739
01:57:46,760 --> 01:57:47,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This way.</b></font>

1740
01:57:52,160 --> 01:57:53,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Get the people on the boats.</b></font>

1741
01:57:53,480 --> 01:57:54,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm not going to leave you here.</b></font>

1742
01:57:54,640 --> 01:57:55,687
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can handle this.</b></font>

1743
01:57:58,000 --> 01:57:59,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come back for me
when everyone else is off.</b></font>

1744
01:57:59,480 --> 01:58:00,970
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not before.</b></font>

1745
01:58:01,600 --> 01:58:02,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You understand?</b></font>

1746
01:58:03,760 --> 01:58:05,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know,
I'm 12 minutes older than you.</b></font>

1747
01:58:05,840 --> 01:58:06,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go.</b></font>

1748
01:58:08,480 --> 01:58:10,005
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Boss,
power levels are way below...</i></b></font>

1749
01:58:10,120 --> 01:58:12,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Reroute everything.
We get one shot at this.</b></font>

1750
01:58:17,240 --> 01:58:18,560
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know what I need to do.</b></font>

1751
01:58:18,840 --> 01:58:19,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The dining room.</b></font>

1752
01:58:20,160 --> 01:58:21,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If I knock out that east wall,</b></font>

1753
01:58:22,080 --> 01:58:23,720
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>it'd make a nice workspace
for Laura, huh?</b></font>

1754
01:58:25,200 --> 01:58:26,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Put up some baffling.</b></font>

1755
01:58:26,480 --> 01:58:28,776
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>She can't hear the kids running around.
What do you think?</b></font>

1756
01:58:28,800 --> 01:58:29,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You guys always eat
in the kitchen anyway.</b></font>

1757
01:58:30,040 --> 01:58:31,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No one eats in a dining room.</b></font>

1758
01:58:37,240 --> 01:58:38,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We don't have a lot of time.</b></font>

1759
01:58:38,960 --> 01:58:40,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So get your ass on a boat.</b></font>

1760
01:58:53,880 --> 01:58:55,006
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, big guy.</b></font>

1761
01:58:56,800 --> 01:58:58,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sun's getting real low.</b></font>

1762
01:58:59,080 --> 01:59:01,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're safe now.
You're gonna be okay. Buckle up.</b></font>

1763
01:59:04,280 --> 01:59:05,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Secure your gear, find a seat.</b></font>

1764
01:59:05,960 --> 01:59:07,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Costel!</b></font>

1765
01:59:08,320 --> 01:59:09,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We were in the market.</b></font>

1766
01:59:09,560 --> 01:59:10,607
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Costel!</b></font>

1767
01:59:25,320 --> 01:59:27,368
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor, I'm gonna
need you back in the church.</b></font>

1768
01:59:27,480 --> 01:59:28,925
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Is this the last of them?
- Yeah.</b></font>

1769
01:59:29,360 --> 01:59:31,920
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Everyone else is on the carrier.
- <i>You know, this works,</i></b></font>

1770
01:59:32,240 --> 01:59:33,651
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>we maybe don't walk away.</b></font>

1771
01:59:34,360 --> 01:59:35,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Maybe not.</b></font>

1772
01:59:54,600 --> 01:59:58,127
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I got no strings, so I have fun.</i></b></font>

1773
01:59:58,600 --> 02:00:01,285
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I'm not tied up to anyone.</i></b></font>

1774
02:00:02,880 --> 02:00:04,211
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come on. Time to go.</b></font>

1775
02:00:36,640 --> 02:00:38,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You didn't see that coming?</b></font>

1776
02:01:34,960 --> 02:01:36,724
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, for God's sake.</b></font>

1777
02:01:53,000 --> 02:01:54,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Zrinka!
- Costel! Baby!</b></font>

1778
02:02:07,240 --> 02:02:08,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, no, I'm fine.</b></font>

1779
02:02:08,400 --> 02:02:09,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fine.</b></font>

1780
02:02:11,240 --> 02:02:13,288
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's been a long day.</b></font>

1781
02:02:27,840 --> 02:02:29,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wanda.</b></font>

1782
02:02:29,760 --> 02:02:33,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>If you stay here, you'll die.</b></font>

1783
02:02:34,600 --> 02:02:35,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I just did.</b></font>

1784
02:02:36,760 --> 02:02:38,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do you know how it felt?</b></font>

1785
02:02:52,600 --> 02:02:54,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It felt like that.</b></font>

1786
02:03:29,960 --> 02:03:31,610
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Thor, on my mark.</b></font>

1787
02:03:46,680 --> 02:03:47,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now!</b></font>

1788
02:04:15,680 --> 02:04:18,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Hey, big guy. We did it.</i></b></font>

1789
02:04:19,160 --> 02:04:20,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The job is finished.</i></b></font>

1790
02:04:21,040 --> 02:04:23,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Now I need you to turn
this bird around, okay?</i></b></font>

1791
02:04:28,040 --> 02:04:29,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We can't track you in stealth mode.</b></font>

1792
02:04:31,960 --> 02:04:34,088
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So help me out. I need you...</i></b></font>

1793
02:05:19,760 --> 02:05:20,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're afraid.</b></font>

1794
02:05:21,760 --> 02:05:22,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Of you?</b></font>

1795
02:05:23,520 --> 02:05:24,681
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Of death.</b></font>

1796
02:05:25,400 --> 02:05:27,209
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're the last one.</b></font>

1797
02:05:27,440 --> 02:05:29,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You were supposed to be the last.</b></font>

1798
02:05:30,120 --> 02:05:32,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Stark asked for a saviour</b></font>

1799
02:05:33,440 --> 02:05:35,124
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and settled for a slave.</b></font>

1800
02:05:35,240 --> 02:05:37,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I suppose we are both disappointments.</b></font>

1801
02:05:40,120 --> 02:05:41,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I suppose we are.</b></font>

1802
02:05:42,080 --> 02:05:43,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Humans are odd.</b></font>

1803
02:05:45,080 --> 02:05:48,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They think order and chaos
are somehow opposites</b></font>

1804
02:05:50,480 --> 02:05:51,811
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and try to control what won't be.</b></font>

1805
02:05:53,520 --> 02:05:55,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But there is grace in their failings.</b></font>

1806
02:05:56,280 --> 02:05:58,203
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think you missed that.</b></font>

1807
02:05:58,880 --> 02:05:59,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They're doomed.</b></font>

1808
02:06:00,880 --> 02:06:01,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes.</b></font>

1809
02:06:06,160 --> 02:06:09,084
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But a thing isn't beautiful
because it lasts.</b></font>

1810
02:06:11,160 --> 02:06:13,162
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's a privilege to be among them.</b></font>

1811
02:06:13,400 --> 02:06:15,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're unbearably naive.</b></font>

1812
02:06:16,200 --> 02:06:17,406
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well...</b></font>

1813
02:06:19,480 --> 02:06:21,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I was born yesterday.</b></font>

1814
02:07:34,160 --> 02:07:36,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Look! Say hi to Auntie Nat!</i></b></font>

1815
02:07:37,600 --> 02:07:38,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fat.</b></font>

1816
02:07:39,720 --> 02:07:41,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>One of our tech boys
flagged this.</b></font>

1817
02:07:42,200 --> 02:07:44,362
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Splashed down in the Banda Sea.</b></font>

1818
02:07:45,480 --> 02:07:47,005
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Could be the Quinjet.</b></font>

1819
02:07:47,360 --> 02:07:49,044
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But with Stark's stealth tech,</b></font>

1820
02:07:49,160 --> 02:07:50,730
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>we still can't track the damn thing.</b></font>

1821
02:07:52,280 --> 02:07:53,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Right.</b></font>

1822
02:07:54,080 --> 02:07:56,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Probably jumped out and swam to Fiji.</b></font>

1823
02:07:57,600 --> 02:07:59,489
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He'll send a postcard.</b></font>

1824
02:07:59,760 --> 02:08:01,489
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"Wish you were here."</b></font>

1825
02:08:03,440 --> 02:08:06,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You sent me to recruit him
way back when.</b></font>

1826
02:08:08,560 --> 02:08:11,131
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Did you know then
what was gonna happen?</b></font>

1827
02:08:13,320 --> 02:08:15,243
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You never know.</b></font>

1828
02:08:15,440 --> 02:08:18,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You hope for the best,
then make do with what you get.</b></font>

1829
02:08:19,440 --> 02:08:20,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I got a great team.</b></font>

1830
02:08:22,040 --> 02:08:24,008
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nothing lasts forever.</b></font>

1831
02:08:24,280 --> 02:08:26,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Trouble, Ms. Romanoff.</b></font>

1832
02:08:26,560 --> 02:08:29,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No matter who wins or loses,
trouble still comes around.</b></font>

1833
02:08:33,800 --> 02:08:35,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The rules have changed.</i></b></font>

1834
02:08:35,200 --> 02:08:36,804
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're dealing
with something new.</b></font>

1835
02:08:36,960 --> 02:08:38,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, the Vision is artificial intelligence.</b></font>

1836
02:08:38,360 --> 02:08:40,283
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- A machine.
- So, it doesn't count?</b></font>

1837
02:08:40,480 --> 02:08:42,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No, it's not like
a person lifting the hammer.</b></font>

1838
02:08:42,560 --> 02:08:44,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Right, different rules for us.</b></font>

1839
02:08:44,440 --> 02:08:45,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Nice guy. Artificial.
- Thank you.</b></font>

1840
02:08:45,680 --> 02:08:48,570
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He can wield the hammer,
he can keep the Mind Stone.</b></font>

1841
02:08:49,480 --> 02:08:51,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's safe with the Vision.</b></font>

1842
02:08:51,800 --> 02:08:54,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And these days, safe is in short supply.</b></font>

1843
02:08:56,360 --> 02:08:58,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But if you put the hammer
in an elevator...</b></font>

1844
02:08:58,440 --> 02:09:00,336
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- It would still go up.
- Elevator's not worthy.</b></font>

1845
02:09:00,360 --> 02:09:02,169
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm gonna miss these little talks of ours.</b></font>

1846
02:09:02,320 --> 02:09:03,845
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not if you don't leave.</b></font>

1847
02:09:04,080 --> 02:09:05,809
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I have no choice.</b></font>

1848
02:09:06,040 --> 02:09:08,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The Mind Stone
is the fourth of the Infinity Stones</b></font>

1849
02:09:08,320 --> 02:09:09,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to show up in the last few years.</b></font>

1850
02:09:09,840 --> 02:09:11,410
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's not a coincidence.</b></font>

1851
02:09:12,240 --> 02:09:14,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Someone has been playing
an intricate game</b></font>

1852
02:09:14,160 --> 02:09:15,810
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and has made pawns of us.</b></font>

1853
02:09:15,920 --> 02:09:17,809
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And once all these pieces
are in position...</b></font>

1854
02:09:17,920 --> 02:09:19,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Triple Yahtzee.</b></font>

1855
02:09:19,560 --> 02:09:21,005
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You think you can find out
what's coming?</b></font>

1856
02:09:21,120 --> 02:09:22,201
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I do.</b></font>

1857
02:09:23,040 --> 02:09:24,530
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Besides this one,</b></font>

1858
02:09:24,640 --> 02:09:27,007
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>there's nothing that can't be explained.</b></font>

1859
02:09:34,320 --> 02:09:36,846
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That man has no regard
for lawn maintenance.</b></font>

1860
02:09:40,000 --> 02:09:42,606
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm gonna miss him, though.
And you're gonna miss me.</b></font>

1861
02:09:42,720 --> 02:09:44,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>There's gonna be a lot of manful tears.</b></font>

1862
02:09:46,480 --> 02:09:48,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I will miss you, Tony.</b></font>

1863
02:09:48,360 --> 02:09:49,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah?</b></font>

1864
02:09:49,520 --> 02:09:51,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, it's time for me to tap out.</b></font>

1865
02:09:52,200 --> 02:09:54,362
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Maybe I should
take a page out of Barton's book.</b></font>

1866
02:09:54,520 --> 02:09:57,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Build Pepper a farm,
hope nobody blows it up.</b></font>

1867
02:09:58,240 --> 02:09:59,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The simple life.</b></font>

1868
02:09:59,680 --> 02:10:01,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- You'll get there one day.
- I don't know.</b></font>

1869
02:10:02,200 --> 02:10:04,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Family, stability...</b></font>

1870
02:10:05,760 --> 02:10:08,889
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The guy who wanted all that
went in the ice 75 years ago.</b></font>

1871
02:10:10,400 --> 02:10:12,243
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think someone else came out.</b></font>

1872
02:10:16,200 --> 02:10:17,281
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You all right?</b></font>

1873
02:10:19,960 --> 02:10:21,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm home.</b></font>

1874
02:10:29,320 --> 02:10:32,085
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You wanna keep staring at the wall,
or do you wanna go to work?</b></font>

1875
02:10:32,240 --> 02:10:33,571
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I mean, it's a pretty interesting wall.</b></font>

1876
02:10:33,760 --> 02:10:36,816
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I thought you and Tony
were still gazing into each other's eyes.</b></font>

1877
02:10:36,840 --> 02:10:37,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How do we look?</b></font>

1878
02:10:38,120 --> 02:10:40,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, we're not the '27 Yankees.</b></font>

1879
02:10:40,560 --> 02:10:42,244
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We got some hitters.</b></font>

1880
02:10:42,400 --> 02:10:44,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They're good. They're not a team.</b></font>

1881
02:10:44,960 --> 02:10:46,610
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's beat them into shape.</b></font>

1882
02:11:05,080 --> 02:11:06,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Avengers...</b></font>

1883
02:13:25,440 --> 02:13:26,885
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fine.</b></font>

1884
02:13:28,320 --> 02:13:30,163
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll do it myself.</b></font>

